WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:12.061
(train horn blowing)

2
00:00:12.129 --> 00:00:15.898
(whistling
<i>The Farmer in the Dell)</i>

3
00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.074
Watch Online Movies and Series for FREE
www.osdb.link/lm

4
00:00:35.018 --> 00:00:36.217
(gun cocking)

5
00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:38.536
(Mouzone)
THAT'S FAR ENOUGH.

6
00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:40.772
DROP YOUR LAUNDRY
AND TURN SLOWLY.

7
00:00:45.679 --> 00:00:47.479
SO YOU GONNA
ROB ME NOW?

8
00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.564
I NEED TO
REMIND YOU WHO I AM?

9
00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:51.800
OMAR. ISN'T IT?

10
00:00:56.340 --> 00:00:58.924
PULL IT SLOWLY.
THEN TOSS IT.

11
00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:01.276
OH. I WILL MOVE SLOW.

12
00:01:01.345 --> 00:01:05.296
I AIN'T TOSSIN'
NOTHIN'. BOW TIE.

13
00:01:05.365 --> 00:01:08.533
SO WHATEVER YOU GONNA DO.
YOU MIGHT AS WELL GO AHEAD
AND MAKE IT QUICK.

14
00:01:09.803 --> 00:01:11.202
I KNEW YOU'D COME BACK.

15
00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:13.082
I TRUST YOU DIDN'T
LOSE SLEEP OVER IT.

16
00:01:13.106 --> 00:01:14.472
WORRYIN' ABOUT YOU
WOULD BE LIKE

17
00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:16.157
WONDERING IF
THE SUN GONNA COME UP.

18
00:01:17.427 --> 00:01:20.195
I AIN'T ABOUT TO
WILD OUT OVER IT.

19
00:01:20.264 --> 00:01:22.264
WHAT I WANT TO KNOW
IS HOW YOU FOUND ME.

20
00:01:22.332 --> 00:01:25.016
YOUR BOY. HE DIDN'T
GIVE YOU UP EASY.

21
00:01:25.085 --> 00:01:27.636
AIN'T NO SUGAR-WATER
RUN THROUGH 'EM VEINS.

22
00:01:27.705 --> 00:01:28.787
YOU KILL HIM?

23
00:01:28.855 --> 00:01:29.988
HE'S RESTING.

24
00:01:31.141 --> 00:01:33.158
I SEE YOU FAVOR A .45.

25
00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:35.444
TONIGHT I DO.

26
00:01:35.512 --> 00:01:38.413
AND I KEEPS ONE
IN THE CHAMBER.
IN CASE YOU PONDERIN'.

27
00:01:38.482 --> 00:01:41.016
(police sirens wailing)

28
00:01:41.085 --> 00:01:42.801
NICE SHOWPIECE YOU GOT THERE.

29
00:01:42.870 --> 00:01:47.138
WALTHER P.P.K. .380.
DOUBLE ACTION.

30
00:01:47.207 --> 00:01:49.074
HEAR THEM WALTHERS
LIKE TO JUMP SOME.

31
00:01:49.142 --> 00:01:51.476
AS WILL YOU.
WITH ONE IN YOUR ELBOW.

32
00:01:51.545 --> 00:01:54.513
THAT GUN AIN'T
GOT ENOUGH FIREPOWER
TO MAKE MY JOINT USELESS.

33
00:01:54.582 --> 00:01:57.082
IT DEFINITELY WON'T
STOP ME FROM EMPTYIN'
OUT HALF MY MAG.

34
00:01:57.150 --> 00:01:58.817
YOU MIGHT NOT HIT ME.

35
00:01:58.886 --> 00:02:00.952
THIS RANGE?
AND THIS CALIBER?

36
00:02:02.622 --> 00:02:04.456
EVEN IF I MISS.
I CAN'T MISS.

37
00:02:04.525 --> 00:02:06.425
I ADMIRE A MAN
WITH CONFIDENCE.

38
00:02:06.493 --> 00:02:09.077
I DON'T SEE
NO SWEAT ON YOUR BROW
NEITHER. BRO.

39
00:02:09.947 --> 00:02:11.996
(rain pattering)

40
00:02:12.967 --> 00:02:15.000
(train horn blaring)

41
00:02:15.069 --> 00:02:17.335
I SUPPOSE WE COULD
STAND HERE ALL NIGHT.

42
00:02:17.404 --> 00:02:18.871
SUPPOSE WE COULD.

43
00:02:19.907 --> 00:02:21.839
OR SETTLE THIS
ONCE AND FOREVER.

44
00:02:24.911 --> 00:02:26.010
(clicking)

45
00:02:27.814 --> 00:02:30.682
I WANT TO ASK YOU
SOMETHING. BROTHER.

46
00:02:36.523 --> 00:02:37.839
OMAR LISTENIN'.

47
00:04:17.724 --> 00:04:21.526
<i>(officers chattering
over police radio)</i>

48
00:04:32.739 --> 00:04:34.179
(officer #1)
<i>I'm going to the West.</i>

49
00:04:34.207 --> 00:04:35.284
(officer #2)
<i>All right.</i>
<i>Peace out.</i>

50
00:04:35.308 --> 00:04:36.575
<i>All right.</i>

51
00:04:38.111 --> 00:04:39.310
HERE WE GO.

52
00:04:45.869 --> 00:04:48.053
(man)
<i>Yo. I need some</i>
<i>face time with the man.</i>

53
00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:50.255
<i>Hold on.</i>
<i>I'll holler back</i>
<i>at you. man.</i>

54
00:04:50.323 --> 00:04:51.556
THAT'D BE SHAMROCK.

55
00:04:51.624 --> 00:04:53.442
ASSUMING
STRINGER BELL IS THE MAN.

56
00:04:53.510 --> 00:04:55.310
NOW WE WAIT
FOR THE RETURN CALL.

57
00:04:56.746 --> 00:04:58.329
THIS IS BEAUTIFUL.

58
00:04:58.382 --> 00:04:59.748
LESTER.
CAN YOU ACTUALLY BELIEVE

59
00:04:59.817 --> 00:05:03.168
WE FUCKIN' SOLD
THE WIRETAPS TO THE TARGETS.

60
00:05:03.237 --> 00:05:05.003
FOR A WEEK AT LEAST.

61
00:05:06.907 --> 00:05:11.175
MAYBE WE DUCKED A BULLET.
MAYBE WE CLEAN
THIS MESS QUIETLY.

62
00:05:11.244 --> 00:05:14.245
THROW SOME HORSESHIT AT
WHATEVER REPORTER SHOWS UP.

63
00:05:14.314 --> 00:05:16.748
AND THE MAYOR
FORGIVES AND FORGETS.

64
00:05:16.817 --> 00:05:18.349
WE'RE READY TO
MOVE ON THIS.
RIGHT?

65
00:05:18.418 --> 00:05:21.219
AS SOON AS WE GET THE WORD.
WE SHUT DOWN ALL 3 ZONES.

66
00:05:21.287 --> 00:05:22.687
TOSS EVERYONE INTO WAGONS.

67
00:05:22.756 --> 00:05:25.073
THERE'LL BE
NOTHING LEFT OF IT
BEFORE MIDNIGHT SHIFT.

68
00:05:25.142 --> 00:05:28.126
SO WHAT THE FUCK
ARE WE WAITIN' ON
FOR A DAY AND HALF?

69
00:05:28.178 --> 00:05:30.111
WHY ISN'T THE HALL
CALLIN' US?

70
00:05:34.651 --> 00:05:36.117
(beeping)

71
00:05:36.185 --> 00:05:37.619
<i>(phone ringing)</i>

72
00:05:37.687 --> 00:05:39.031
(woman)
<i>Mayor's office.</i>

73
00:05:39.055 --> 00:05:41.690
COMMISSIONER BURRELL
FOR MAYOR ROYCE.

74
00:05:41.758 --> 00:05:43.742
I'VE HEARD ENOUGH.
HOLD ON. COLEMAN.

75
00:05:43.810 --> 00:05:45.443
COME ON.
LET THE MAN TALK. HUH?

76
00:05:45.512 --> 00:05:47.895
EXCUSE ME. MAYOR. I HAVE
COMMISSIONER BURRELL
ON THE LINE.

77
00:05:47.965 --> 00:05:50.148
HE SAYS IT'S URGENT.
I'LL BET IT IS.

78
00:05:50.217 --> 00:05:52.100
HE WANTS TO MOVE. CLARENCE.

79
00:05:52.168 --> 00:05:54.886
HE WANTS TO
CLEAN THIS SHIT UP
YESTERDAY. AND SO DO WE.

80
00:05:54.955 --> 00:05:57.489
TELL HIM TO HOLD.
GO AHEAD. GENE.

81
00:05:57.558 --> 00:06:01.226
LOOK. I'M NOT A POLITICIAN.
I'M AN ACADEMIC.

82
00:06:01.294 --> 00:06:03.895
ALL I KNOW IS THAT FROM
A PUBLIC HEALTH PERSPECTIVE

83
00:06:03.964 --> 00:06:06.204
THERE ARE REMARKABLE THINGS
HAPPENING IN THE FREE ZONES.

84
00:06:06.265 --> 00:06:10.351
NEEDLE EXCHANGES.
ON-SITE BLOOD TESTING.
CONDOM DISTRIBUTION.

85
00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:12.971
MOST OF ALL.
WE'RE INTERACTING
WITH AN AT-RISK COMMUNITY

86
00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.806
THAT IS LARGELY ELUSIVE.

87
00:06:14.875 --> 00:06:17.270
I MEAN. WE'RE... WE'RE EVEN
TALKING SOME OF THESE PEOPLE
INTO DRUG TREATMENT.

88
00:06:17.294 --> 00:06:20.262
AND THAT'S JUST
WHAT U.M. AND BON SECOURS
HAVE BROUGHT TO THE TABLE.

89
00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:21.847
IF THIS THING
WERE SANCTIONED.

90
00:06:21.915 --> 00:06:24.549
MY DEPARTMENT COULD PUT
PUBLIC RESOURCES INTO PLAY.

91
00:06:24.617 --> 00:06:27.385
YOU PEOPLE CAN'T
SEE THE FOREST HERE.

92
00:06:27.454 --> 00:06:29.137
ODELL?

93
00:06:29.222 --> 00:06:33.491
WHEN THE STORY BREAKS.
THE MINISTERS WILL
SURELY BE AGAINST YOU.

94
00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.394
AND MOST OF THE CITY COUNCIL
WILL BE WALKING SIDEWAYS

95
00:06:36.463 --> 00:06:38.063
AWAY FROM
YOUR ADMINISTRATION.

96
00:06:38.131 --> 00:06:40.932
(Watkins)
AND MY GUESS IS THE GOVERNOR
AND THE LEGISLATURE

97
00:06:41.001 --> 00:06:44.553
WILL USE THIS OPPORTUNITY
TO PISS ON THE CITY
FROM A GREAT HEIGHT.

98
00:06:44.621 --> 00:06:47.155
AND WASHINGTON? OH...

99
00:06:47.223 --> 00:06:50.876
CAN YOU IMAGINE HOW FAR
THE UNITED STATES
DEPARTMENT OF JUSTICE

100
00:06:50.944 --> 00:06:53.378
IS GONNA CRAWL UP
YOUR ASS BEHIND THIS?

101
00:06:53.446 --> 00:06:55.647
CRIME IS DOWN. ODELL.

102
00:06:57.284 --> 00:06:59.796
MEDICAL PEOPLE
ARE TELLING ME
THIS COULD WORK.

103
00:06:59.820 --> 00:07:03.755
I MEAN. A 14% DECLINE
IN FELONIES CITYWIDE.

104
00:07:03.824 --> 00:07:06.792
I MIGHT BE UNTOUCHABLE
ON THIS. NOW. LOOK.
WE NEED TO THINK.

105
00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:08.437
SEE IF WE CAN
KEEP THIS THING GOIN'

106
00:07:08.461 --> 00:07:10.123
WITHOUT CALLIN' IT
WHAT IT REALLY IS. HUH?

107
00:07:10.147 --> 00:07:11.813
JESUS.

108
00:07:11.882 --> 00:07:14.026
OH. NOW. THERE'S GOT TO
BE A WAY. I WANT YOU
TO TALK THIS THING OUT.

109
00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:15.610
HEY. ERV.
THANKS FOR HOLDIN'.

110
00:07:15.852 --> 00:07:17.452
YES. BUT...

111
00:07:17.520 --> 00:07:20.121
<i>(Mayor chattering
indistinctly on phone)</i>

112
00:07:20.958 --> 00:07:22.490
YES. I UNDERSTAND.

113
00:07:24.127 --> 00:07:26.177
THEN I'LL WAIT
TO HEAR FROM YOU.

114
00:07:27.614 --> 00:07:30.731
WE'RE TO HOLD OFF
ON ANY ACTION IN HAMSTERDAM.

115
00:07:30.800 --> 00:07:34.719
NO ARRESTS.
NO MOVEMENT
UNTIL FURTHER NOTICE.

116
00:07:34.788 --> 00:07:37.421
HE SAYS HE WANTS TO REGROUP.

117
00:07:37.490 --> 00:07:40.625
DETERMINE THE MOST EFFECTIVE
COURSE OF ACTION.

118
00:07:40.694 --> 00:07:42.694
TRANSLATE THAT
FOR ME. WILL YOU. ERV?

119
00:07:42.763 --> 00:07:44.603
I DON'T SPEAK HIS
FUCKED-UP LINGO.

120
00:07:44.664 --> 00:07:48.599
ROYCE IS FIGURIN' A WAY
TO PUT ALL OF US
IN THE GUILLOTINE

121
00:07:48.668 --> 00:07:51.770
AND KEEP THE BLOOD
FROM SPRAYING
ANYWHERE NEAR THE HALL.

122
00:07:51.838 --> 00:07:54.956
SHIT. I'LL BE GODDAMNED
IF I'M GONNA GO OUT
LIKE THAT.

123
00:07:55.024 --> 00:07:57.091
BENT OVER IN PUBLIC.

124
00:07:57.160 --> 00:07:59.877
I CAN SPIN THE STORY
JUST AS WELL AS
THAT MOTHERFUCKER.

125
00:07:59.946 --> 00:08:01.390
YOU'RE GONNA GO
TO THE PRESS?

126
00:08:01.414 --> 00:08:02.597
NOT ME.

127
00:08:02.666 --> 00:08:04.516
BUT I KNOW
A SLICK LITTLE BASTARD

128
00:08:04.584 --> 00:08:07.084
WHO WILL HAPPILY PUT
HIS HONOR'S SHIT
IN THE STREET.

129
00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.323
SOMETHIN' FUNNY
ABOUT THAT?

130
00:08:12.376 --> 00:08:13.853
'CAUSE I LOOK
IN THE PAPER

131
00:08:13.877 --> 00:08:15.654
AND I SEE ALL
THESE FEDERAL GRANTS
COMIN' DOWN.

132
00:08:15.678 --> 00:08:16.994
BUT NONE FOR B. AND B.

133
00:08:18.398 --> 00:08:19.764
YOU'RE EXPECTING WHAT?

134
00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:21.449
PAYOUT.

135
00:08:21.517 --> 00:08:23.401
A BIG PAYOUT FOR
WHAT WE PUT IN. MAN.

136
00:08:23.470 --> 00:08:25.537
FEDERAL DOLLARS ON THEM
HOWARD STREET REHABS.

137
00:08:25.605 --> 00:08:26.804
YOU GAVE MONEY UP FRONT?

138
00:08:26.873 --> 00:08:28.406
$250.000. YEP.

139
00:08:28.474 --> 00:08:29.741
TO CLAY DAVIS.

140
00:08:31.445 --> 00:08:32.677
HOW YOU KNOW?

141
00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.930
WHAT YOU SAYIN'?
HE'S RUNNIN' GAME?

142
00:08:35.998 --> 00:08:38.344
NO. HELL. NO.
HE AIN'T THAT BRAZEN.
MMM-MMM.

143
00:08:38.368 --> 00:08:39.934
LET ME GUESS.

144
00:08:40.002 --> 00:08:42.169
HE'S TOLD YOU
ABOUT THE FAUCET.

145
00:08:42.239 --> 00:08:45.073
OR WAS IT THE GOOSE
THAT LAID THE GOLDEN EGG?

146
00:08:45.141 --> 00:08:46.808
YOU EVER ACTUALLY
MEET THE MAN?

147
00:08:46.877 --> 00:08:49.828
DID YOU EVER ACTUALLY
SEE ANY OF YOUR CASH
REACH ANYONE IN AUTHORITY?

148
00:08:49.897 --> 00:08:52.041
YEAH. I MET THE GUY AT
THE FEDERAL BUILDING.
YEAH. I MET HIM.

149
00:08:52.065 --> 00:08:53.364
YEAH? WHAT OFFICE?

150
00:08:55.319 --> 00:08:56.834
HE CAME DOWN TO THE LOBBY.

151
00:09:02.041 --> 00:09:04.258
HE RAIN-MADE YOU.

152
00:09:04.327 --> 00:09:06.894
A GUY SAYS IF YOU PAY HIM.
HE CAN MAKE IT RAIN.

153
00:09:06.963 --> 00:09:08.096
YOU PAY HIM.

154
00:09:08.164 --> 00:09:09.998
IF AND WHEN IT RAINS.
HE TAKES THE CREDIT.

155
00:09:10.066 --> 00:09:13.334
IF AND WHEN IT DOESN'T.
HE FINDS REASONS FOR
YOU TO PAY HIM MORE.

156
00:09:13.402 --> 00:09:15.052
CLAY DAVIS RAIN-MADE YOU.

157
00:09:15.121 --> 00:09:17.950
NO. MAN. HE... HE GOT
THEM BUILDIN' PERMITS
IN NO TIME AT ALL. MAN.

158
00:09:17.974 --> 00:09:19.974
I MEAN. WE BRIBIN'
THESE MOTHERFUCKERS.

159
00:09:20.042 --> 00:09:21.859
HE GOT THE CITY
CONTRACTOR'S MONEY BACK.

160
00:09:21.928 --> 00:09:22.928
HOW MUCH?

161
00:09:22.996 --> 00:09:24.111
$35.000 SO FAR.

162
00:09:24.180 --> 00:09:25.663
ON THE $250.000
YOU GAVE HIM?

163
00:09:25.732 --> 00:09:26.976
IT'S FOR BRIBIN'
THE MOTHERFUCKERS.

164
00:09:27.000 --> 00:09:29.417
THERE ARE NO BRIBES!

165
00:09:29.485 --> 00:09:32.420
YOU REALLY THINK
A STATE SENATOR
IS GOING TO RISK HIS...

166
00:09:32.489 --> 00:09:35.590
HIS SALARY AND
HIS POSITION BY WALKING
INTO A FEDERAL OFFICE

167
00:09:35.659 --> 00:09:37.509
WITH A BRIEFCASE
FULL OF DRUG MONEY?

168
00:09:37.577 --> 00:09:39.493
I SEEN. UH. CHUNKY.
CHUNKY COATES.

169
00:09:39.562 --> 00:09:41.882
CHUNKY COATES
GETS HIS GRANT MONEY
SAME WAY EVERYONE DOES.

170
00:09:41.915 --> 00:09:44.515
HE FILLS OUT APPLICATIONS.
HE MAKES SURE
THE PLANS MEET SPEC.

171
00:09:44.584 --> 00:09:47.102
THEN HE PRAYS LIKE HELL.

172
00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:51.138
THIS IS AN OLD
GAME IN THIS TOWN.
AND CLAY DAVIS?

173
00:09:51.208 --> 00:09:53.925
THAT <i>GANEF</i> WAS BORN
WITH HIS HAND
IN SOMEONE'S POCKET.

174
00:09:53.994 --> 00:09:56.127
I JUST WISH
YOU'D RUN IT
BY ME SOONER.

175
00:10:09.676 --> 00:10:12.877
NOW HERE'S SHAMROCK
RETURNIN' BODIE'S CALL.

176
00:10:12.946 --> 00:10:14.379
(Bodie)
<i>Talk light.</i>

177
00:10:14.447 --> 00:10:16.814
<i>Yo. the man said</i>
<i>he'd see you</i>
<i>same time as always.</i>

178
00:10:16.883 --> 00:10:18.649
<i>You know the spot.</i>

179
00:10:18.718 --> 00:10:21.297
DURING THE FIRST CALL.
SYDNOR HAD EYES ON SHAMROCK
OVER IN WEST BALTIMORE.

180
00:10:21.321 --> 00:10:23.722
ALL RIGHT?
NOW LOOK AT THIS.

181
00:10:23.790 --> 00:10:27.325
AT THE TIME.
STRINGER BELL WAS
AT THE PRINT SHOP.

182
00:10:27.393 --> 00:10:29.272
SO IT COULDN'T BE
A FACE-TO-FACE MEET.

183
00:10:29.296 --> 00:10:31.857
WE DIDN'T CATCH
A CALL BETWEEN
STRINGER AND SHAMROCK.

184
00:10:31.881 --> 00:10:33.281
HOW CAN THAT BE?

185
00:10:33.350 --> 00:10:36.751
STRINGER'S PHONE ISN'T
ON THE SAME NETWORK
AS EVERYONE BELOW HIM.

186
00:10:36.820 --> 00:10:38.235
RIGHT YOU ARE. MA'AM.

187
00:10:38.288 --> 00:10:40.288
BELL'S NOT USING
BERNARD'S BURNERS.

188
00:10:40.356 --> 00:10:43.874
AND SHAMROCK HAS
A SEPARATE PHONE
FOR CALLIN' BELL.

189
00:10:43.943 --> 00:10:48.045
WE CAN'T HEAR THOSE CALLS
BECAUSE THE SYSTEM'S
COMPARTMENTALIZED.

190
00:10:48.114 --> 00:10:49.747
THEY'RE SOME
TRICKY MOTHERFUCKERS.

191
00:10:49.816 --> 00:10:52.616
A WEEK OR SO UP
ON BERNARD'S PHONES
AND WE'LL HAVE EVERYBODY.

192
00:10:52.685 --> 00:10:55.853
UP TO AND INCLUDING SHAMROCK.
TANGLED UP IN
CONSPIRACY COUNTS.

193
00:10:55.922 --> 00:10:57.438
BUT BELL OR BARKSDALE?

194
00:10:57.507 --> 00:11:00.324
NOT UNLESS WE CAN
PLUCK THEIR CELL NUMBERS
OUT OF THE AIR.

195
00:11:03.296 --> 00:11:04.440
WHERE YOU
HEADED?

196
00:11:04.464 --> 00:11:05.530
TOY STORE.

197
00:11:09.335 --> 00:11:11.603
HE LEGALIZED DRUGS
IN SPECIAL ZONES?

198
00:11:12.839 --> 00:11:14.555
IT'S MORE THAN THAT.

199
00:11:14.624 --> 00:11:17.925
MAJOR COLVIN LOST
THE NECESSARY PERSPECTIVE

200
00:11:17.994 --> 00:11:20.561
THAT IS REQUIRED FOR COMMAND.

201
00:11:20.630 --> 00:11:22.230
NOW. WE WERE ALL
UNDER PRESSURE

202
00:11:22.298 --> 00:11:24.315
TO REDUCE CRIME
BEFORE YEAR-END.

203
00:11:24.384 --> 00:11:27.018
AND HE RESPONDED
POORLY TO THAT PRESSURE.

204
00:11:27.086 --> 00:11:29.120
PRESSURE BY WHO? MAYOR?

205
00:11:29.989 --> 00:11:32.523
I'M JUST EXPLAINING TO YOU

206
00:11:32.592 --> 00:11:35.993
THAT THE PRESSURE
WAS APPLIED
ALL DOWN THE LINE.

207
00:11:36.062 --> 00:11:38.630
FROM HEADQUARTERS
TO THE DISTRICT COMMANDERS

208
00:11:38.698 --> 00:11:41.365
TO THE SHIFT
AND SECTOR SUPERVISORS.

209
00:11:41.434 --> 00:11:44.502
SO COLVIN'S
14% DECLINE
WAS BULLSHIT.

210
00:11:44.571 --> 00:11:46.087
(scoffing)

211
00:11:46.172 --> 00:11:49.307
AND THEY'RE SELLIN' DRUGS
WITH POLICE PERMISSION
IN WESTERN?

212
00:11:49.376 --> 00:11:52.476
THE DEPARTMENT
IS READY TO
SHUT THAT MESS DOWN

213
00:11:52.545 --> 00:11:53.945
WITH MASS ARRESTS.

214
00:11:54.014 --> 00:11:55.579
I'M ON TOP OF IT.

215
00:11:55.648 --> 00:11:57.215
WHY DON'T YOU MOVE?

216
00:11:57.284 --> 00:11:59.683
(laughing)
THE MAYOR SAYS WAIT.

217
00:12:00.620 --> 00:12:01.719
WHY?

218
00:12:03.122 --> 00:12:05.256
I THINK HE'S GONNA MAKE
SOME KIND OF SHOW.

219
00:12:05.324 --> 00:12:07.358
SPIN IT SO THAT
I TAKE THE WEIGHT
FOR SOMETHIN'

220
00:12:07.427 --> 00:12:08.927
THAT HAS
NOTHING TO DO WITH ME.

221
00:12:08.995 --> 00:12:10.595
AND EVERYTHING TO DO
WITH THE PRESSURE

222
00:12:10.664 --> 00:12:13.731
THAT MY COMMANDERS
WERE GETTING FROM CITY HALL.

223
00:12:18.939 --> 00:12:23.607
GOING PUBLIC AND
PUTTING THE RESPONSIBILITY
FOR THIS BACK AT CITY HALL

224
00:12:23.676 --> 00:12:26.727
IS THE ONLY MOVE
I HAVE LEFT. RIGHT?

225
00:12:26.796 --> 00:12:29.897
I MEAN. I SPIN ROYCE
BEFORE HE SPINS ME.

226
00:12:29.966 --> 00:12:31.199
AND YOU WANT ME TO. UH...

227
00:12:31.268 --> 00:12:32.417
NO. NO. NOT YOU.

228
00:12:32.485 --> 00:12:34.268
YOUR PAL. TONY GRAY.

229
00:12:34.337 --> 00:12:36.137
IF HE'S GONNA
TAKE A RUN AT ROYCE.

230
00:12:36.206 --> 00:12:38.072
HE'S GONNA NEED
AMMUNITION. RIGHT?

231
00:12:40.776 --> 00:12:42.043
(sighing)

232
00:12:42.112 --> 00:12:44.128
I DON'T HAVE
A RELATIONSHIP
WITH GRAY.

233
00:12:44.197 --> 00:12:46.163
I DO HAVE ONE WITH YOU.

234
00:12:46.232 --> 00:12:49.350
AND. COUNCILMAN. YOU OWE ME.

235
00:12:55.125 --> 00:12:56.457
(Fitzhugh)
WHAT'S UP. HOTSHOT?

236
00:12:56.526 --> 00:12:59.060
I GOT A TECHNICAL QUESTION.
REMEMBER THOSE ANALOG UNITS

237
00:12:59.128 --> 00:13:01.274
WE USED TO USE
TO PULL CELL NUMBERS
OUT OF THE AIR?

238
00:13:01.298 --> 00:13:03.064
C.F.-SOMETHIN'-SOMETHIN'.

239
00:13:03.132 --> 00:13:05.466
YEAH. CELL FREQUENCY
IDENTIFICATION DEVICE.

240
00:13:05.535 --> 00:13:06.717
THE TRIGGERFISH. YEAH.

241
00:13:06.786 --> 00:13:08.263
THAT ONE.
IT COULD FLAG A NUMBER.

242
00:13:08.287 --> 00:13:10.021
RIGHT. WITH THE OLD
ANALOG MACHINES.

243
00:13:10.090 --> 00:13:11.567
WE USED TO HAVE TO
FOLLOW THE GUY AROUND.

244
00:13:11.591 --> 00:13:12.968
STAY CLOSE WHILE
HE USED THE PHONE.

245
00:13:12.992 --> 00:13:14.441
NEW DIGITALS?

246
00:13:14.510 --> 00:13:16.655
BING.
YOU JUST PULL THE NUMBER
RIGHT OFF THE CELL TOWER.

247
00:13:16.679 --> 00:13:18.908
SO. YOU GOT ANY
DOWN OUT AT WOODLAWN
THAT DADDY CAN BORROW?

248
00:13:18.932 --> 00:13:19.997
WHAT ABOUT YOURS?

249
00:13:20.066 --> 00:13:21.098
WHAT?

250
00:13:21.167 --> 00:13:23.062
CITY HAS 3 OF 'EM.
IF I REMEMBER RIGHT.

251
00:13:23.086 --> 00:13:24.969
HOMELAND SECURITY GRANT
SENT 'EM TO YOU.

252
00:13:25.037 --> 00:13:26.877
EVERY BIG COUNTY
DEPARTMENT IN THE STATE.

253
00:13:26.906 --> 00:13:28.173
NO FUCKIN' WAY.

254
00:13:28.908 --> 00:13:31.009
(engine starting)

255
00:13:31.077 --> 00:13:32.242
THANKS.

256
00:13:37.083 --> 00:13:38.282
I DOUBTED YOU. TOMMY.

257
00:13:38.351 --> 00:13:39.450
I TOLD YOU IT WAS BIG.

258
00:13:39.519 --> 00:13:40.919
IF WE PLAY IT RIGHT.

259
00:13:40.987 --> 00:13:43.065
HE WANTS ME TO
TURN THE INFORMATION
OVER TO TONY GRAY.

260
00:13:43.089 --> 00:13:46.169
LET HIM USE IT. HE FIGURES
IF TONY'S GONNA BE
RUNNIN' AGAINST THE MAYOR.

261
00:13:46.193 --> 00:13:48.153
HE'LL TAKE AIM AT ROYCE
AND NOT THE DEPARTMENT.

262
00:13:48.177 --> 00:13:49.877
YOU MAY WANT TO
BRING TONY IN ON IT.

263
00:13:49.946 --> 00:13:51.662
KEEP HIM VIABLE
AGAINST THE MAYOR.

264
00:13:51.731 --> 00:13:54.091
BUT RIGHT NOW.
YOU NEED TO FIND OUT
WHAT THIS IS ALL ABOUT.

265
00:13:54.134 --> 00:13:56.884
FIRSTHAND.
DO YOU KNOW
THIS MAJOR COLVIN?

266
00:13:56.952 --> 00:13:59.253
TO SHAKE HANDS. MAYBE.

267
00:13:59.322 --> 00:14:01.572
IF BURRELL'S
PAINTING HIM THE VILLAIN.

268
00:14:01.641 --> 00:14:04.608
COLVIN MIGHT BE ANXIOUS
TO TELL SOMEONE HIS
SIDE OF THE STORY.

269
00:14:07.747 --> 00:14:10.681
<i>(rock music playing on radio)</i>

270
00:14:14.253 --> 00:14:16.587
McNULTY. MAJOR CRIMES.

271
00:14:16.656 --> 00:14:18.523
SULLIVAN.
MINOR IRRITATIONS.

272
00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:23.461
YOU GOT ANYTHING BACK THERE
THAT'S LIKE THE OLD C.F.I.D..
BUT DIGITAL?

273
00:14:23.530 --> 00:14:24.812
FOR CATCHIN'
CELL NUMBERS?

274
00:14:24.881 --> 00:14:26.030
CATCHIN' WHO?

275
00:14:26.098 --> 00:14:27.765
YOU KNOW.
A TRIGGERFISH MACHINE.

276
00:14:29.436 --> 00:14:31.769
TRIGGERFISH.
FOR CELL NUMBERS.

277
00:14:35.325 --> 00:14:37.391
HOW ABOUT I LOOK
AROUND THERE ON MY OWN?

278
00:14:51.891 --> 00:14:53.903
YES. THIS IS
COUNCILMAN CARCETTI
OVER AT THE HALL.

279
00:14:53.927 --> 00:14:55.337
I'M TRYIN' TO
REACH MAJOR COLVIN.

280
00:14:55.361 --> 00:14:57.041
(woman)
<i>I'm sorry.</i>
<i>but he's on vacation.</i>

281
00:14:57.097 --> 00:14:59.942
I'M AWARE OF THAT
BUT I'M TRYIN' TO REACH HIM
ON MUNICIPAL BUSINESS.

282
00:14:59.966 --> 00:15:01.777
<i>Well. I can put you
through to his voicemail.</i>

283
00:15:01.801 --> 00:15:02.934
NO. NOT HIS VOICEMAIL.

284
00:15:03.002 --> 00:15:04.379
I SAID I HAVE TO
REACH HIM IMMEDIATELY.

285
00:15:04.403 --> 00:15:05.536
<i>Immediately?</i>

286
00:15:05.605 --> 00:15:07.038
RIGHT.
<i>How about his cell phone?</i>

287
00:15:07.107 --> 00:15:08.617
HIS CELL?
YEAH. THAT WOULD BE FINE.

288
00:15:08.641 --> 00:15:09.874
<i>All right.</i>

289
00:15:11.177 --> 00:15:13.077
<i>(music playing on stereo)</i>

290
00:15:13.146 --> 00:15:15.196
(grunting)

291
00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:19.383
(Cutty)
ALL RIGHT. THAT'S ENOUGH.

292
00:15:21.254 --> 00:15:23.454
(swearing)
YEAH. I KNOW. IT HURTS.

293
00:15:23.523 --> 00:15:26.243
BUT YOUR FISTS
GONNA BE LIKE
ROCKS AFTER AWHILE.

294
00:15:30.463 --> 00:15:31.930
JUSTIN. COME HERE.

295
00:15:34.667 --> 00:15:37.018
ALL RIGHT. I WANT YOU
TO PUSH ME IN MY CHEST.

296
00:15:37.086 --> 00:15:38.920
YOU AIN'T GOT TO
DO IT HARD.

297
00:15:42.224 --> 00:15:43.785
THAT'S HOW
YOU WERE STANDIN'.

298
00:15:43.809 --> 00:15:45.421
YOU AIN'T HAD NO
WEIGHT ON YOUR BACK FOOT.

299
00:15:45.445 --> 00:15:47.678
THAT'S RIGHT.
NO CENTER OF GRAVITY.

300
00:15:47.747 --> 00:15:50.148
PLUS. IF YOU GET
YOUR STANCE RIGHT.

301
00:15:50.216 --> 00:15:52.545
THEN YOU GOT THE MEANS
TO PUT YOUR HIP
INTO THE PUNCH.

302
00:15:52.569 --> 00:15:53.618
(grunting)

303
00:15:53.670 --> 00:15:55.202
RIGHT?

304
00:15:55.271 --> 00:15:57.049
THAT'S WHERE YOUR
POWER'LL COME FROM.

305
00:15:57.073 --> 00:15:59.090
YEAH. BUT WHAT HAPPEN
WHEN WE GET HIT?

306
00:15:59.159 --> 00:16:00.307
SAY WHAT?

307
00:16:00.376 --> 00:16:03.010
WE GET HIT.
EVEN WITH THIS PAD.

308
00:16:03.946 --> 00:16:05.446
YOU GONNA GET TRUCKED.

309
00:16:05.515 --> 00:16:07.364
ALL THIS STUFF FALLIN' APART.

310
00:16:07.433 --> 00:16:09.267
YEAH. THE HEAVY BAG. TOO.

311
00:16:09.335 --> 00:16:12.248
YEAH. WHERE YOU GET
THIS STUFF AT?
THE TOWN OF BEDROCK?

312
00:16:12.272 --> 00:16:14.272
(boys laughing)

313
00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:15.690
(man)
NO. HE SAY. "NOBODY."

314
00:16:15.758 --> 00:16:17.185
SO YOU GONNA HAVE
TO WAIT RIGHT HERE.

315
00:16:17.209 --> 00:16:18.453
(Stringer)
WHAT YOU MEAN.

316
00:16:18.477 --> 00:16:20.397
"WAIT RIGHT HERE?"
YOU KNOW WHO I AM. BOY?

317
00:16:21.364 --> 00:16:23.064
MAN SAY
HE WANT TO SEE AVON.

318
00:16:23.133 --> 00:16:24.948
MAKIN' ME WAIT TO
SEE MY OWN PARTNER.

319
00:16:25.017 --> 00:16:26.851
HE NEW. STRING.
FUCK THAT.

320
00:16:26.919 --> 00:16:28.697
LOT OF NEW FACES
ROUND HERE. MAN.

321
00:16:28.721 --> 00:16:30.254
WAY TOO MANY. YOU ASK ME.

322
00:16:31.057 --> 00:16:32.522
GET THE FUCK OUT OF HERE.

323
00:16:32.591 --> 00:16:34.791
<i>(hip-hop music
playing on stereo)</i>

324
00:16:37.196 --> 00:16:38.763
WHERE AVON AT?

325
00:16:38.831 --> 00:16:40.531
HE'LL BE ALONG SHORTLY.

326
00:16:40.583 --> 00:16:43.303
THAT'S GOOD.
'CAUSE I CAME TO
SEE YOU. ANYWAY.

327
00:16:43.736 --> 00:16:44.952
WHAT YOU NEED?

328
00:16:53.696 --> 00:16:55.679
I NEED YOU TO HIT SOMEBODY.

329
00:16:55.749 --> 00:16:56.814
WHO WE HITTIN'?

330
00:16:57.967 --> 00:16:59.117
CLAY DAVIS.

331
00:16:59.185 --> 00:17:00.968
THE CLAY DAVIS?

332
00:17:01.036 --> 00:17:02.636
DOWNTOWN CLAY DAVIS?

333
00:17:02.705 --> 00:17:04.905
IS THAT SUPPOSE TO MEAN
SOMETHIN' TO ME. MAN?

334
00:17:04.974 --> 00:17:06.023
THAT NIGGA NEED TO BE GOT.

335
00:17:06.092 --> 00:17:08.325
SHIT. STRING.
MURDER AIN'T NO THING.

336
00:17:08.394 --> 00:17:10.427
BUT THIS HERE IS SOME
ASSASSINATION SHIT...

337
00:17:10.496 --> 00:17:12.774
I TELL YOU
YOU GETTIN' SOMEBODY.
YOU GETTIN' HIM.

338
00:17:12.798 --> 00:17:13.865
I AIN'T ASKIN'.

339
00:17:13.933 --> 00:17:15.193
DAMN. STRING. I DON'T KNOW...
NIGGA.

340
00:17:15.217 --> 00:17:17.418
I GOT TO REMIND YOU
WHO THE FUCK YOU WORK FOR?

341
00:17:17.487 --> 00:17:18.785
HEY. YO.

342
00:17:18.854 --> 00:17:21.322
I THINK SLIM GONNA HAVE
TO SIT THIS ONE OUT. BOSS.

343
00:17:22.858 --> 00:17:25.619
SO YOU FINNA
GO HIT A STATE
SENATOR NOW. HUH?

344
00:17:26.812 --> 00:17:29.452
YO. YOU KILL
A DOWNTOWN NIGGA
LIKE THAT.

345
00:17:29.515 --> 00:17:32.435
THE WHOLE WORLD
GONNA STAND UP
AND TAKE NOTICE.

346
00:17:32.852 --> 00:17:35.319
I'M TALKIN' ABOUT
THE STATE POLICE.

347
00:17:35.387 --> 00:17:39.189
FEDERALS. ALL OF THAT.

348
00:17:39.258 --> 00:17:41.992
YOU NEED A
<i>DAY OF THE JACKAL</i> TYPE
MOTHERFUCKER. BASICALLY.

349
00:17:42.061 --> 00:17:44.812
TO DO SOME SHIT LIKE THAT.
NOT A ROUGH-AND-TUMBLE
NIGGA LIKE SLIM.

350
00:17:44.881 --> 00:17:46.575
THAT NIGGA TOOK
OUR MONEY. MAN.

351
00:17:46.599 --> 00:17:47.698
I SEEN IT COMIN'.

352
00:17:47.767 --> 00:17:50.367
WELL. HE GOT TO GO.

353
00:17:50.436 --> 00:17:52.169
NO. YOU A FUCKIN'
BUSINESSMAN.

354
00:17:52.238 --> 00:17:53.804
YOU WANNA
HANDLE IT LIKE THAT.

355
00:17:53.873 --> 00:17:56.574
YOU DON'T WANNA
GET ALL GANGSTER WILD
WITH IT AND SHIT. RIGHT?

356
00:17:58.061 --> 00:18:00.578
WHAT I TELL YOU
ABOUT PLAYIN' 'EM
FUCKIN' AWAY GAMES?

357
00:18:05.001 --> 00:18:06.984
(Avon)
YEAH.

358
00:18:07.053 --> 00:18:10.154
THEY SAW YOUR
GHETTO ASS COMIN'
FROM MILES AWAY. NIGGA.

359
00:18:11.423 --> 00:18:13.474
YOU GOT A FUCKIN'
BEEF WITH THEM?

360
00:18:13.543 --> 00:18:15.375
THAT SHIT IS ON YOU.

361
00:18:20.549 --> 00:18:25.119
SO. WE AIM THIS AT
THE NEAREST CELL TOWER.

362
00:18:25.188 --> 00:18:27.288
THE ONE THAT WOULD BE
THE CONDUIT FOR CALLS

363
00:18:27.356 --> 00:18:29.523
COMIN' TO AND FROM
OUR BOY. BELL.

364
00:18:31.494 --> 00:18:34.562
AND WE LET RIP.

365
00:18:36.365 --> 00:18:37.431
(both exclaiming)

366
00:18:37.500 --> 00:18:38.916
FUCKIN' HELL.

367
00:18:38.968 --> 00:18:40.813
(Freamon)
LOOKS LIKE
BALTIMORE WHITE PAGES

368
00:18:40.837 --> 00:18:42.169
WITHOUT ANY NAMES.

369
00:18:42.237 --> 00:18:44.488
BUT THE PATTERN
TRACE'LL PULL THAT DOWN.

370
00:18:44.557 --> 00:18:46.936
YOU KNOW. IF WE KNOW
THE APPROXIMATE
TIME OF BELL'S CALL.

371
00:18:46.960 --> 00:18:49.760
WE COULD START
JUST BY PULLIN' CALLS
OFF THAT TOWER AT THAT TIME.

372
00:18:49.828 --> 00:18:51.579
THAT COULD BE THOUSANDS.

373
00:18:51.647 --> 00:18:54.214
YEAH. THAT'S THE BASE LINE.
BUT WE GET A SECOND HIT

374
00:18:54.283 --> 00:18:55.916
AND THAT LIST
COMES DOWN TO DOZENS.

375
00:18:55.985 --> 00:18:57.117
AND AFTER A 3RD OR 4TH...

376
00:18:57.186 --> 00:18:58.569
THEN WE'VE GOT
HIS NUMBER.

377
00:18:58.638 --> 00:19:00.121
YOU KNOW.
I CAN'T BELIEVE

378
00:19:00.189 --> 00:19:03.240
THAT THIS WAS JUST
SITTIN' OVER AT I.S.D..
GATHERIN' DUST.

379
00:19:03.309 --> 00:19:05.954
WE'RE GOING TO BE ON
THESE MOTHERFUCKERS
FOR REAL NOW. LESTER.

380
00:19:05.978 --> 00:19:08.412
WELL. THEY DON'T KNOW
ABOUT THIS TECHNOLOGY YET.

381
00:19:08.480 --> 00:19:10.731
FOR ONCE THEY CAN'T
CHANGE AND ADJUST.

382
00:19:10.800 --> 00:19:11.849
IT'S GENIUS.

383
00:19:12.635 --> 00:19:14.935
(chattering)

384
00:19:25.081 --> 00:19:27.764
(singing)

385
00:19:38.110 --> 00:19:39.510
NEED SOMETHING?

386
00:19:39.579 --> 00:19:41.299
YEAH. HOW MUCH
YOU MAKE. MAN?

387
00:19:41.514 --> 00:19:43.163
WHAT?

388
00:19:43.232 --> 00:19:44.952
ON THEM TEES?
HOW MUCH YOU MAKE?

389
00:19:47.553 --> 00:19:49.687
FAIR PROFIT.
NO MORE THAN THAT.

390
00:19:52.008 --> 00:19:54.008
YOU SHOULD PROBABLY
SELL SWEATS
WITH HOODIES.

391
00:19:54.076 --> 00:19:56.243
SINCE THE SEASON'S
CHANGIN' AND ALL.

392
00:19:58.547 --> 00:19:59.797
WHERE YOU LIVE AT?

393
00:20:06.256 --> 00:20:08.333
(man)
YELLOW TOPS. YELLOW TOPS.
GOT 'EM YELLOW TOPS.

394
00:20:08.357 --> 00:20:09.556
BODIE BROADUS.

395
00:20:09.625 --> 00:20:12.410
THE MAN WITH THE HANDS.

396
00:20:12.478 --> 00:20:14.912
I HEARD YOU WAS. UM.
OPENIN' UP A GYM
OR SOMETHIN'.

397
00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:16.414
YEAH. TRYIN' TO.

398
00:20:16.482 --> 00:20:18.242
I'M LOOKIN' TO
GET UP WITH AVON.

399
00:20:18.817 --> 00:20:20.184
THOUGHT YOU WAS OUT.

400
00:20:20.253 --> 00:20:22.036
HEY. MAN. THAT'S WHY
I CAME TO YOU.

401
00:20:22.104 --> 00:20:24.171
I MEAN. I FEEL LIKE
THE WAY WE LEFT IT.

402
00:20:24.239 --> 00:20:26.199
I CAN'T JUST ROLL UP
ON THE MAN. YOU KNOW?

403
00:20:30.129 --> 00:20:31.562
(cell phone beeping)

404
00:20:33.532 --> 00:20:34.965
HEY. YO. IT'S ME.

405
00:20:35.034 --> 00:20:37.051
YO. I GOT THAT
HITTER HERE WITH ME.

406
00:20:37.119 --> 00:20:39.302
YEAH. THE SOLDIER
THAT WALKED IN AND OUT.

407
00:20:39.371 --> 00:20:41.105
YEAH. HE WANT TO
SEE THE TOP MAN.

408
00:20:42.391 --> 00:20:43.824
(moaning)

409
00:20:43.893 --> 00:20:46.843
YOU SLAM SHIT LIKE THAT.
YOU GONNA FALL OUT ONE DAY.

410
00:20:46.912 --> 00:20:48.745
(people chattering)

411
00:20:48.814 --> 00:20:49.846
I'M GOOD.

412
00:20:51.284 --> 00:20:53.250
I'M TRYIN' TO
SCHOOL YOU. BOY.

413
00:20:53.319 --> 00:20:55.118
AND YOU JUST
DON'T WANNA KNOW.

414
00:20:56.088 --> 00:20:57.621
(sniffing)

415
00:20:59.825 --> 00:21:02.993
I'M COOL.
I'M GOOD.

416
00:21:03.062 --> 00:21:05.462
(Bubbles)
WHITEY SALE. WHITEY SALE.

417
00:21:05.531 --> 00:21:08.031
YEAH. 1 FOR 3.
3 FOR 5.

418
00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:09.633
WHITEY SALE.

419
00:21:13.306 --> 00:21:16.407
WHITEY SALE. WHITEY SALE.
WHITEY SALE. HERE.

420
00:21:16.475 --> 00:21:18.125
1 FOR 3. 3 FOR 5.

421
00:21:27.403 --> 00:21:29.002
WHITEY SALE. WHITEY SALE.

422
00:21:33.809 --> 00:21:35.809
WHITEY SALE. WHITEY SALE!

423
00:21:42.501 --> 00:21:45.002
(Bodie)
<i>All right. so what you</i>
<i>want me to tell the man?</i>

424
00:21:45.071 --> 00:21:47.471
<i>Yo. I'll give word up.
then I'll hit you back.</i>

425
00:21:47.539 --> 00:21:48.672
SHAMROCK.

426
00:21:49.641 --> 00:21:51.575
4:40 P.M.

427
00:21:56.966 --> 00:21:57.966
(tapping desk)

428
00:22:02.388 --> 00:22:04.255
(cell phone ringing)

429
00:22:09.928 --> 00:22:11.462
B. AND B. ENTERPRISES.

430
00:22:11.530 --> 00:22:13.263
(man)
<i>We need to have lunch.</i>

431
00:22:13.332 --> 00:22:15.299
ALL RIGHT. HOLD ON.
I'LL CALL YOU BACK.

432
00:22:39.241 --> 00:22:40.441
(phone beeping on)

433
00:22:41.444 --> 00:22:42.592
(burping)

434
00:22:44.096 --> 00:22:45.228
YO.

435
00:22:45.297 --> 00:22:46.329
(man)
<i>Hey. it's me.</i>

436
00:22:46.399 --> 00:22:47.932
WHAT'S GOOD?

437
00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:49.450
(cell phone ringing)

438
00:22:49.518 --> 00:22:51.719
<i>(music playing)</i>

439
00:22:51.787 --> 00:22:53.203
YEAH. IT'S ME.

440
00:22:53.272 --> 00:22:54.533
(Shamrock)
<i>Yo. tell the hitter.</i>

441
00:22:54.557 --> 00:22:56.256
<i>tell him the tall man
will pick him up.</i>

442
00:22:56.325 --> 00:22:57.402
(Bodie)
<i>Right.</i>

443
00:22:57.426 --> 00:22:59.560
4:47.
7-MINUTE WINDOW.

444
00:23:03.282 --> 00:23:06.817
THERE'S 892 PHONE NUMBERS.
THAT'S OUR BASE LINE.

445
00:23:06.886 --> 00:23:08.535
WE'RE ON OUR WAY.
YEP.

446
00:23:24.036 --> 00:23:25.753
STAY THE FUCK THERE. MAN.

447
00:23:34.130 --> 00:23:35.162
YO.

448
00:23:45.307 --> 00:23:48.025
JIMMY!
ON THE CLEAN PHONE.

449
00:23:49.361 --> 00:23:51.162
HE JUST HIT YOUR
FRIEND'S NUMBER.

450
00:23:51.230 --> 00:23:53.397
THE ONE OFF
THE BUSINESS CARD
YOU GAVE ME.

451
00:23:55.234 --> 00:23:56.733
THE WESTERN?

452
00:23:56.803 --> 00:23:58.068
HIS CELL.

453
00:24:01.274 --> 00:24:02.973
SHOULD WE BE
WORRIED ABOUT THIS?

454
00:24:05.311 --> 00:24:06.376
NO.

455
00:24:07.396 --> 00:24:08.962
(Avon)
A BOXING GYM. HUH?

456
00:24:09.031 --> 00:24:10.430
AIN'T A PROPER ONE YET.

457
00:24:10.499 --> 00:24:12.077
THAT'S WHY I
ASKED TO SEE YOU.

458
00:24:12.101 --> 00:24:13.600
<i>(hip-hop music playing)</i>

459
00:24:13.668 --> 00:24:16.097
SO. WHAT YOU KNOW
ABOUT TAKIN' CARE OF
SOMETHIN' LIKE THAT?

460
00:24:16.121 --> 00:24:17.721
NOT A DAMN THING.

461
00:24:17.789 --> 00:24:19.657
BUT I KNOW THAT
SWEET SCIENCE.

462
00:24:19.725 --> 00:24:21.424
AND I GOT SOME KIDS
WHO ARE INTERESTED.

463
00:24:21.493 --> 00:24:25.162
BUT WHAT I GOT
A NEED FOR. BROTHER.
IS EQUIPMENT.

464
00:24:25.231 --> 00:24:27.531
MAN. THESE KIDS
GONNA GET RAINED ON.

465
00:24:27.599 --> 00:24:31.268
THEY NEED HEADGEAR.
THEY NEED GUARDS. CUPS.

466
00:24:31.337 --> 00:24:33.037
YOU KNOW.
SO THEY CAN TAKE THE HIT.

467
00:24:33.105 --> 00:24:34.871
SHOOT. YOU KNOW
WHAT I'M SAYIN'. MAN.

468
00:24:34.940 --> 00:24:37.420
I SEEN YOUR PICTURE
ON THEM GLOBE POSTERS
BACK IN THE DAY.

469
00:24:37.476 --> 00:24:39.443
LITTLE UNDERCARD SHIT.
MAYBE. YOU KNOW.

470
00:24:39.512 --> 00:24:41.645
YEAH. BUT STILL.
YOU WAS GOLDEN GLOVES.

471
00:24:41.714 --> 00:24:45.081
FOR A MINUTE.
BUT I HAD
A PHYSICAL DEFECT.

472
00:24:45.150 --> 00:24:47.083
WHAT. YOU GOT A GLASS JAW?

473
00:24:47.152 --> 00:24:49.002
NO. FOREHEAD. NIGGA.

474
00:24:49.088 --> 00:24:51.722
CRANIUM SHOT'LL
DO YOU WRONG. MAN.

475
00:24:51.790 --> 00:24:53.356
YO. LOOK HERE. MAN.

476
00:24:53.425 --> 00:24:55.192
YOU SEE
THE NEW HEAVY BAGS?

477
00:24:55.260 --> 00:24:57.595
LOOK. FREESTANDIN'. MAN.

478
00:24:57.663 --> 00:24:59.396
ALL YOU GOTTA DO
IS ADD WATER.

479
00:24:59.465 --> 00:25:01.031
HMM.
THEN YOU GOT...

480
00:25:01.099 --> 00:25:03.533
SPEED BAGS.
RIGHT THERE. RIGHT?

481
00:25:03.602 --> 00:25:06.120
YOU GOT THIS HEADGEAR
RIGHT HERE. IT'S NEW.

482
00:25:06.188 --> 00:25:10.006
LOOK. PROTECT
THE CHEEK AND THE CHIN.
YOU KNOW?

483
00:25:10.076 --> 00:25:14.144
AND I KNOW I CAN GO AROUND
AND COLLECT A DOLLAR
HERE AND A DOLLAR THERE.

484
00:25:14.213 --> 00:25:16.980
BUT I'M TRYIN' TO
PUT TOGETHER A SELECT
GROUP OF PEOPLE. RIGHT?

485
00:25:17.049 --> 00:25:20.317
I CALL 'EM MY...
MY GOLD CIRCLE CLUB.

486
00:25:20.385 --> 00:25:23.020
AND THEY GONNA MAKE
A SUBSTANTIAL CONTRIBUTION

487
00:25:23.089 --> 00:25:25.622
AND JUST GET THIS
THING ROLLING RIGHT.

488
00:25:25.674 --> 00:25:27.807
I MEAN.
I'M GONNA PUT THEIR NAME

489
00:25:27.876 --> 00:25:30.494
AND PICTURE UP ON
THE WALL IN THE GYM.

490
00:25:30.563 --> 00:25:32.762
WHAT. YOU TRYIN' TO
GET ME TO JOIN A CLUB?

491
00:25:32.831 --> 00:25:34.531
NO. MAN. I'M JUST SAYING.

492
00:25:34.600 --> 00:25:36.566
THERE...
THERE'S ALL SORTS OF LEVELS.

493
00:25:36.636 --> 00:25:39.803
THAT... WE GOT THE.
WE GOT THE SILVER CLUB.
WE GOT THE BRONZE CLUB.

494
00:25:39.872 --> 00:25:43.941
MAN. FOR MOTHERFUCKERS
WHO REALLY DON'T
WANT TO DIG THAT DEEP.

495
00:25:44.010 --> 00:25:45.409
COME ON. MAN. CHECK IT OUT.

496
00:25:45.461 --> 00:25:48.462
NO. MAN.
I AIN'T GOT NO TIME FOR
THIS BULLSHIT. MAN.

497
00:25:48.547 --> 00:25:51.426
AND YOU KNOW I DON'T
WANT MY FUCKIN' NAME
AND FACE ON NO DAMN WALL.

498
00:25:51.450 --> 00:25:52.932
YOU CRAZY. NIGGA?

499
00:25:53.002 --> 00:25:54.762
HOW MUCH MONEY
YOU TALKIN' ABOUT?

500
00:25:58.974 --> 00:26:00.190
$10.000.

501
00:26:06.916 --> 00:26:09.060
(Avon)
SEE HIM GO THROUGH
ALL THAT FOR $10.000?

502
00:26:09.084 --> 00:26:10.284
(both laughing)

503
00:26:10.352 --> 00:26:13.404
MAN. SLIM.
GO GET HIM
$15.000 CASH. MAN.

504
00:26:14.873 --> 00:26:16.407
YO...

505
00:26:16.475 --> 00:26:18.241
SHIT.

506
00:26:18.311 --> 00:26:19.676
ALL RIGHT. LATER. MAN.

507
00:26:19.745 --> 00:26:21.623
HEY. YOU TAKE CARE
OF THEM LITTLE NIGGAS.
YOU HEAR?

508
00:26:21.647 --> 00:26:22.880
MAN. NO DOUBT. BRO.

509
00:26:41.083 --> 00:26:42.216
<i>(phone ringing)</i>

510
00:26:42.284 --> 00:26:44.017
(sighing)

511
00:26:44.086 --> 00:26:45.152
(Bodie)
<i>Yeah.</i>

512
00:26:45.221 --> 00:26:47.587
YO. YOU TALK TO HIM?

513
00:26:47.656 --> 00:26:49.356
<i>Fat man wanna parlay.</i>

514
00:26:51.426 --> 00:26:53.193
ALL RIGHT. YOU GOOD.
HOOK ME UP.

515
00:26:53.262 --> 00:26:54.962
<i>Yeah. all right.</i>

516
00:26:55.797 --> 00:26:56.797
(beeping)

517
00:27:24.476 --> 00:27:26.410
YOU CHECK OUT
WHAT I SENT YOU?

518
00:27:30.315 --> 00:27:33.534
YEAH.
YOUR INFORMATION'S GOOD.

519
00:27:33.602 --> 00:27:36.322
SO. WE CAN TALK
ON THE REAL SIDE
NOW. HUH?

520
00:27:43.462 --> 00:27:45.422
(Stringer)
<i>Tell your man</i>
<i>I'm good for tomorrow.</i>

521
00:27:45.447 --> 00:27:46.808
(Bodie)
<i>Yo. I'll hit you back.</i>

522
00:27:46.832 --> 00:27:48.082
NOW WE'RE COOKIN'.

523
00:27:48.150 --> 00:27:49.983
CUTTIN' BUTTER
WITH A HOT KNIFE.

524
00:27:50.052 --> 00:27:53.770
NEXT TIME STRINGER BELL TAKES
A CALL OFF THE BASE LINE.
HE'S OURS. GAME OVER.

525
00:27:53.839 --> 00:27:54.904
(Massey)
MMM-HMM.

526
00:27:55.958 --> 00:27:57.591
(crickets chirping)

527
00:27:59.228 --> 00:28:02.145
SO. IT AIN'T WHAT
IT MIGHT SEEM TO YOU.

528
00:28:02.213 --> 00:28:03.947
THAT MAN THERE IS MY BROTHER.

529
00:28:04.015 --> 00:28:05.482
(cell phone ringing)

530
00:28:05.551 --> 00:28:07.934
BUT IF IT KEEP ON
LIKE IT BEEN. THEN...

531
00:28:09.554 --> 00:28:11.288
OH. FUCK.

532
00:28:12.240 --> 00:28:13.373
YOU GOT PROBLEMS?

533
00:28:13.459 --> 00:28:16.343
I STIRRED UP SOME SHIT
WITH THIS HAMSTERDAM MESS.

534
00:28:17.429 --> 00:28:19.346
THAT'S 'CAUSE
YOU WAS BEHIND THAT.

535
00:28:19.415 --> 00:28:21.331
THAT MADE ME COME
TO YOU WITH THIS.

536
00:28:23.919 --> 00:28:26.904
LOOK LIKE YOU AND ME
BOTH TRYIN' TO MAKE
SENSE OF THIS GAME.

537
00:28:29.975 --> 00:28:31.775
SPEAK YOUR MIND. RUSSELL.

538
00:28:31.844 --> 00:28:34.745
<i>(soul music playing on stereo)</i>

539
00:28:34.813 --> 00:28:36.346
(vehicles passing)

540
00:28:43.439 --> 00:28:44.755
WE TWO GOOD?

541
00:28:46.025 --> 00:28:47.057
YEAH.

542
00:28:49.194 --> 00:28:51.929
WE GOT Y'ALL OUT FRONT.
LET'S GO. P-SQUARE.

543
00:28:58.170 --> 00:28:59.436
YOU LOOK HEALTHY.

544
00:29:00.272 --> 00:29:02.072
FOR A MAN WHO WAS GUT-SHOT.

545
00:29:03.625 --> 00:29:06.209
YOU REACHED OUT
TO A THIRD PARTY

546
00:29:06.278 --> 00:29:09.379
WHO ENGAGED ME
IN THE PURPOSE OF
HOLDING YOUR TOWERS.

547
00:29:09.447 --> 00:29:13.250
THAT THIRD PERSON'S WORD
WAS YOUR WORD.
AS HE REPRESENTED YOU.

548
00:29:13.319 --> 00:29:14.584
THAT'S RIGHT.

549
00:29:14.653 --> 00:29:17.170
AND I RAN THOSE
EAST BALTIMORE
GENTLEMEN OFF.

550
00:29:17.239 --> 00:29:19.923
I HELD UP MY END
OF THE AGREEMENT.

551
00:29:19.992 --> 00:29:22.659
AT LEAST FOR AS LONG AS
I WAS PHYSICALLY ABLE.

552
00:29:22.728 --> 00:29:23.843
YOU DID.

553
00:29:23.912 --> 00:29:26.963
YOUR MAN THEN SET UP
A MEET AT BUTCHIE'S BAR.

554
00:29:27.032 --> 00:29:29.516
YOUR MAN TOLD OMAR LITTLE
THAT I WAS RESPONSIBLE

555
00:29:29.584 --> 00:29:31.118
FOR THE TORTURE
OF A YOUNG BOY

556
00:29:31.187 --> 00:29:33.486
WHO WAS CLOSE
TO MR. LITTLE'S HEART.

557
00:29:33.555 --> 00:29:36.023
YOUR MAN. IN EFFECT.

558
00:29:36.091 --> 00:29:37.807
SOUGHT TO HAVE ME HIT.

559
00:29:37.876 --> 00:29:40.321
OMAR TOLD YOU THAT
AND YOU BELIEVE
THAT MOTHERFUCKER?

560
00:29:40.345 --> 00:29:43.530
HE DOESN'T STRIKE ME
AS A MAN WHO
WOULD TELL STORIES.

561
00:29:43.599 --> 00:29:45.398
EVEN AT THE POINT OF DYING.

562
00:29:46.234 --> 00:29:47.333
SHIT.

563
00:29:49.204 --> 00:29:50.336
(muttering)

564
00:29:50.405 --> 00:29:52.045
PROPOSITION
JOE PACKAGE.

565
00:29:52.090 --> 00:29:55.341
THE INNER WORKINGS
OF YOUR ORGANIZATION
DON'T CONCERN ME.

566
00:29:57.379 --> 00:29:59.746
IF THERE'S A WAY.
I MEAN. IF MY MAN...

567
00:30:01.250 --> 00:30:05.219
IF HE MADE A MISTAKE HERE.
THEN I'M WILLIN'
TO PAY THE COST.

568
00:30:11.393 --> 00:30:14.177
HOW CAN WE FIX IT?
YOU WANT MONEY?

569
00:30:15.597 --> 00:30:16.947
MONEY?
YEAH.

570
00:30:17.016 --> 00:30:18.364
THIS IS BUSINESS.

571
00:30:18.433 --> 00:30:21.001
BUSINESS IS
WHERE YOU ARE NOW.

572
00:30:21.070 --> 00:30:24.705
BUT WHAT GOT YOU HERE
IS YOUR WORD
AND YOUR REPUTATION.

573
00:30:24.773 --> 00:30:28.141
WITH THAT ALONE.
YOU'VE STILL GOT
AN OPEN LINE TO NEW YORK.

574
00:30:28.210 --> 00:30:30.243
WITHOUT IT. YOU'RE DONE.

575
00:30:48.113 --> 00:30:50.831
MY MAN'S STILL ON PAPER.

576
00:30:50.899 --> 00:30:53.717
I CAN PUT HIM
IN A SPOT THAT GOT
HEAVY ARTILLERY.

577
00:30:53.785 --> 00:30:57.303
I AIN'T TALKIN' ABOUT
PISTOLS. I'M TALKIN' ABOUT
MINI TEC-9s.

578
00:30:57.372 --> 00:31:00.139
SHOTGUNS.
THEY EVEN GOT GRENADES
IN THAT MOTHERFUCKER.

579
00:31:00.208 --> 00:31:01.820
WELL. THAT'S A
AUTOMATIC FALL.

580
00:31:01.844 --> 00:31:04.778
SO. I'M HOPIN' YOU COULD
KEEP THAT SHIT TO 5.

581
00:31:04.846 --> 00:31:06.380
LOOK. IF YOU HIT
THE JOINT.

582
00:31:06.448 --> 00:31:08.393
HIS PEOPLE ARE GONNA TRY
AND TAKE THE RAP FOR IT.

583
00:31:08.417 --> 00:31:11.001
THEY GONNA SAY ALL
THAT FIREPOWER IS THEIRS.

584
00:31:11.070 --> 00:31:14.471
SO ALL YOU GOTTA DO
IS JUST HIT HIM
WITH THE PAROLE BACKUP.

585
00:31:14.540 --> 00:31:17.423
LOOK. I CAN'T MAKE
NO PROMISES.

586
00:31:17.492 --> 00:31:18.953
IT'S GONNA BE
A NICKEL. AT LEAST.

587
00:31:18.977 --> 00:31:20.310
COME ON. MAN.

588
00:31:23.549 --> 00:31:25.075
HIM AND ME...
I'M GONNA DO MY BEST.

589
00:31:25.099 --> 00:31:26.299
ALL RIGHT?

590
00:31:29.004 --> 00:31:30.764
NOW. HE'S ALWAYS
AT THIS PLACE?

591
00:31:32.908 --> 00:31:34.841
NO. HE COME AND GO.

592
00:31:34.910 --> 00:31:37.311
BUT IT'S THE SPOT
SINCE THE WAR STARTED.

593
00:31:57.049 --> 00:31:58.929
HE MUST HAVE DONE
SOMETHIN' TO YOU.

594
00:32:02.588 --> 00:32:04.220
NO. IT'S JUST BUSINESS.

595
00:32:18.286 --> 00:32:20.787
(computer beeping)

596
00:32:22.157 --> 00:32:24.677
ALMOST FORGOT.
THIS CAME IN FOR
YOU LAST NIGHT.

597
00:32:24.709 --> 00:32:26.788
SAID SHE CALLED
YOUR CELL PHONE.
BUT YOU DIDN'T ANSWER.

598
00:32:26.812 --> 00:32:29.111
HAD A NICE VOICE.
LIKE A KITTY CAT.

599
00:32:29.180 --> 00:32:31.714
(Massey chuckling)

600
00:32:31.783 --> 00:32:33.263
(Freamon)
WE'RE ON.

601
00:32:35.087 --> 00:32:37.037
(man)
<i>He said for you</i>
<i>to be there. half-pint.</i>

602
00:32:37.106 --> 00:32:38.626
(Bodie)
<i>Yeah. okay.</i>

603
00:32:40.025 --> 00:32:41.858
(typing)

604
00:32:46.998 --> 00:32:49.332
STRINGER BELL. THAT'S HIM.
THERE IT IS.

605
00:32:49.401 --> 00:32:51.267
YEAH. BUT FOR HOW LONG?

606
00:32:51.336 --> 00:32:53.487
HE COULD TOSS THAT
BURNER AT ANY MOMENT.

607
00:32:55.374 --> 00:32:56.773
I GOT RHONDA.
YOU RAISE DANIELS.

608
00:32:56.841 --> 00:32:58.141
(Freamon)
OK.

609
00:33:01.063 --> 00:33:02.573
RONNIE? YEAH.
WE'RE ON STRINGER'S PHONE.

610
00:33:02.597 --> 00:33:04.381
LIEUTENANT.

611
00:33:04.450 --> 00:33:06.677
YOU SHOULD GO STRAIGHT TO
THE JUDGE. I'LL MEET YOU
THERE WITH AN AFFIDAVIT.

612
00:33:06.701 --> 00:33:08.901
LESTER'S RAISING DANIELS.
McNULTY'S CALLING PEARLMAN.

613
00:33:13.675 --> 00:33:15.208
WATCH THAT FOOTWORK. BABY.

614
00:33:15.277 --> 00:33:17.777
ALL RIGHT.
TAKE IT TO HIM. NOW.

615
00:33:17.846 --> 00:33:19.596
YEAH. TAKE IT TO HIM. NOW.

616
00:33:22.601 --> 00:33:23.900
I'M A BEAST. COACH.

617
00:33:23.969 --> 00:33:26.636
ALL RIGHT. BOY.
DON'T BE GLOATIN' ON IT.

618
00:33:26.705 --> 00:33:28.315
YO. WHEN WE GONNA
HAVE SOME REAL FIGHTS?

619
00:33:28.339 --> 00:33:29.989
YOU KNOW. ONE OF
THEM TOURNAMENT THINGS.

620
00:33:30.075 --> 00:33:31.525
YEAH. WE GLADIATORS. SON.

621
00:33:31.593 --> 00:33:33.877
Y'ALL GOT MORE
FIRE THAN SKILLS.

622
00:33:33.945 --> 00:33:37.046
YOU AIN'T READY FOR NO
FULL-BLOWN THING JUST YET.

623
00:33:37.115 --> 00:33:39.349
BUT I DON'T KNOW.
MAYBE IT'D BE GOOD FOR Y'ALL

624
00:33:39.418 --> 00:33:41.351
TO SPAR WITH SOME
BOYS YOU DON'T KNOW.

625
00:33:41.420 --> 00:33:44.187
A NIGGA STEP IN MY HOUSE.
HE GETTIN' DROPPED.

626
00:33:44.256 --> 00:33:48.124
YO. I MET THESE
FELLAS AT THAT GYM
OVER ON PENNSYLVANIA AVENUE.

627
00:33:48.193 --> 00:33:50.376
I'LL SEE IF THEY WANNA
ROLL THROUGH. ALL RIGHT?

628
00:33:50.445 --> 00:33:52.005
ALL RIGHT.
ALL RIGHT.

629
00:33:59.988 --> 00:34:01.971
YOU DON'T RETURN
A COUNCILMAN'S CALLS?

630
00:34:04.226 --> 00:34:05.692
I'M OFF THIS WEEK.

631
00:34:07.462 --> 00:34:09.445
TAKING A LITTLE
ACCRUED VACATION.

632
00:34:09.514 --> 00:34:11.130
YEAH. AND I HEARD WHY.

633
00:34:12.784 --> 00:34:14.768
I'M HERE FOR YOUR
SIDE OF THIS STORY.

634
00:34:14.837 --> 00:34:16.336
IF I CAN'T GET THAT

635
00:34:16.404 --> 00:34:18.832
THEN WHATEVER COMES OUT
OF BURRELL'S MOUTH
IS GONNA STAND.

636
00:34:18.856 --> 00:34:20.323
YOU GOOD WITH THAT?

637
00:34:21.059 --> 00:34:23.210
WHAT DID YOU DO. MAJOR?

638
00:34:23.278 --> 00:34:25.228
AND WHY THE FUCK
HAVEN'T THEY SHUT IT DOWN?

639
00:34:25.297 --> 00:34:28.264
WE'VE SEEN THAT
LAW ENFORCEMENT'S
STEAMROLLER APPROACH

640
00:34:28.333 --> 00:34:30.300
IS JUST SPITTING IN THE WIND!
I REALLY THINK.

641
00:34:30.368 --> 00:34:32.649
I REALLY THINK THAT
YOU'RE ONTO SOMETHING
HERE. CLARENCE.

642
00:34:32.704 --> 00:34:33.970
BUT IF YOU KEEP IT UP.

643
00:34:34.038 --> 00:34:35.550
BEFORE YOU KNOW IT
THEY'LL BE CALLING YOU

644
00:34:35.574 --> 00:34:37.073
THE MOST DANGEROUS
MAN IN AMERICA.

645
00:34:37.142 --> 00:34:40.009
WELL. I KNOW
IT MAY APPEAR THAT WE'RE
VULNERABLE HERE. HUH?

646
00:34:40.078 --> 00:34:42.312
BUT IF WE ENFORCE
THE DRUG LAWS

647
00:34:42.380 --> 00:34:45.215
EVERYWHERE ELSE
IN THE CITY
AGGRESSIVELY. HOW...

648
00:34:45.283 --> 00:34:48.012
HOW CAN THEY SAY
WE'RE NOT A LAW AND
ORDER ADMINISTRATION?

649
00:34:48.036 --> 00:34:51.370
NOW THERE'S GOT TO BE
A MIDDLE GROUND HERE
THAT WE HAVE YET TO FIND.

650
00:34:51.439 --> 00:34:53.606
THERE'S GOT TO BE SOME WAY
TO ACCOMPLISH THIS

651
00:34:53.675 --> 00:34:55.725
WITHOUT TURNIN'
EVERYTHING UPSIDE DOWN.

652
00:34:56.878 --> 00:34:59.879
THIS USED TO BE ONE
OF MY WORST CORNERS.

653
00:34:59.948 --> 00:35:01.348
(Carcetti)
THIS IS THE NEIGHBORHOOD

654
00:35:01.383 --> 00:35:03.250
WHERE A COP GOT SHOT
LAST SUMMER. RIGHT?

655
00:35:03.318 --> 00:35:04.501
DOZERMAN.

656
00:35:04.553 --> 00:35:05.685
LOOKS QUIET NOW.

657
00:35:08.156 --> 00:35:09.889
SO DO MOST
ALL MY CORNERS.

658
00:35:15.264 --> 00:35:16.363
G-MAN.

659
00:35:16.431 --> 00:35:18.398
(phone ringing)

660
00:35:22.271 --> 00:35:23.469
(knocking)

661
00:35:23.538 --> 00:35:24.938
SO. WHAT'S UP?

662
00:35:25.507 --> 00:35:26.672
SHUT THE DOOR.

663
00:35:32.097 --> 00:35:36.132
IN 10 MINUTES WE'RE GONNA
HAVE AN AFFIDAVIT
FOR A CITY JUDGE TO SIGN.

664
00:35:36.201 --> 00:35:38.101
IT'S FOR RUSSELL BELL'S
DIRTY CELL.

665
00:35:38.169 --> 00:35:39.635
IT'S A GOOD PULL.

666
00:35:39.704 --> 00:35:43.139
IT IS IF BAY WIRELESS
DOESN'T TAKE 5 DAYS
TO PROCESS IT.

667
00:35:43.207 --> 00:35:44.858
YOU OWE ME. FITZ.

668
00:35:44.926 --> 00:35:46.726
THAT WHOLE PORT CASE
CAME DOWN EARLY

669
00:35:46.794 --> 00:35:48.995
BEHIND SOME UGLY SHIT
IN YOUR HOUSE.

670
00:35:50.999 --> 00:35:55.318
NOW.
I DON'T CARE HOW YOU DO IT.
BUT I NEED MY WIRE TODAY.

671
00:35:58.824 --> 00:36:00.089
(chattering)

672
00:36:00.158 --> 00:36:02.436
THESE GUYS WERE
IN RADIO CARS
2 MONTHS AGO.

673
00:36:02.460 --> 00:36:05.061
CHASING CALLS.
CLEARING CORNERS.

674
00:36:05.130 --> 00:36:06.996
I PULLED 'EM
TO DO FELONY FOLLOW-UP.

675
00:36:07.065 --> 00:36:08.932
MORE POLICE WORK.
LESS BULLSHIT.

676
00:36:09.000 --> 00:36:10.816
AND THAT'S WHY
MY CRIME IS DOWN.

677
00:36:11.886 --> 00:36:13.252
THE NUMBERS ARE TRUE.

678
00:36:13.321 --> 00:36:15.288
(phones ringing)

679
00:36:15.357 --> 00:36:16.839
WHAT DID HE DO?

680
00:36:16.908 --> 00:36:18.708
CHURCH BURGLARIES.
14 OF 'EM.

681
00:36:21.380 --> 00:36:22.445
LET'S GO.

682
00:36:25.551 --> 00:36:27.250
AH. <i>MADEMOISELLE.</i>

683
00:36:29.188 --> 00:36:31.621
IS IT AFFIANT
OR AFFIANT?

684
00:36:31.690 --> 00:36:33.056
I'VE NEVER BEEN...

685
00:36:33.124 --> 00:36:35.225
I'VE NEVER BEEN
CLEAR ON THAT.

686
00:36:35.293 --> 00:36:37.827
(piano music playing)

687
00:36:37.896 --> 00:36:39.874
YOU BEEN HUNTIN'
THIS GUY BELL
FOR A LONG TIME.

688
00:36:39.898 --> 00:36:41.798
HAVEN'T YOU. JIMMY?

689
00:36:41.867 --> 00:36:43.132
A WHILE. YEAH.

690
00:36:44.285 --> 00:36:46.636
(Judge Phelan)
NAME'S FAMILIAR TO ME.

691
00:36:46.688 --> 00:36:49.650
THAT THING THAT WE DID
A FEW YEARS BACK.
WAS. WAS HE THE. UH...

692
00:36:49.674 --> 00:36:50.724
YEAH.

693
00:36:53.262 --> 00:36:54.902
WHAT'S DONE
IS DONE. JIMMY.

694
00:36:56.598 --> 00:36:59.278
NOW. FOR YOUR
OWN FUCKIN' SAKE.
JUST LET IT GO.

695
00:37:01.686 --> 00:37:02.752
COME ON.

696
00:37:05.390 --> 00:37:06.989
AS THE AFFIANT.

697
00:37:07.058 --> 00:37:09.142
DO YOU SOLEMNLY
SWEAR AND ATTEST

698
00:37:09.210 --> 00:37:11.777
THAT THE INFORMATION
CONTAINED IN THIS DOCUMENT...

699
00:37:11.846 --> 00:37:14.247
THAT'S THE MOST
SIGNIFICANT DROP IN CRIME

700
00:37:14.316 --> 00:37:16.416
IN THIS DISTRICT
IN RECENT HISTORY.

701
00:37:16.484 --> 00:37:18.484
(clapping)

702
00:37:18.553 --> 00:37:20.231
(woman)
WE STILL GOT
SOME HARD-LOOKIN' BOYS

703
00:37:20.255 --> 00:37:21.687
OUT ON THEM STREETS.

704
00:37:21.756 --> 00:37:24.841
AND. SERGEANT. YOU KNOW THEM
LITTLE MINI-MOTORCYCLES?

705
00:37:24.910 --> 00:37:26.842
THEY KEEPIN' ME
UP AT NIGHT.

706
00:37:26.911 --> 00:37:28.511
WE'RE WORKIN' ON THAT.

707
00:37:28.579 --> 00:37:31.158
LOOK. I HAVE BEEN LIVING
IN THIS PART OF
THE CITY MY WHOLE LIFE.

708
00:37:31.182 --> 00:37:34.417
AND I CAN TELL YOU
SOMETHING. WE WEREN'T ANY
ANGELS WHEN WE WERE KIDS.

709
00:37:34.486 --> 00:37:36.519
AND THOSE. UH. HARD BOYS
YOU TALKIN' ABOUT.

710
00:37:36.588 --> 00:37:39.455
HALF OF 'EM. THEY'S JUST
PLAYIN' GANGSTER.

711
00:37:39.524 --> 00:37:41.707
THEY AIN'T NO DIFFERENT
FROM WHAT WE WERE.

712
00:37:41.776 --> 00:37:44.293
SHIRTS AND DRAWERS
A LITTLE LONGER. IS ALL.

713
00:37:44.362 --> 00:37:45.829
(all laughing)

714
00:37:45.897 --> 00:37:48.998
THE ONE THING
I DO. UH. MISS ABOUT.
UH. MY NEIGHBORHOOD.

715
00:37:49.067 --> 00:37:51.061
I'M TALKING ABOUT
THE NEIGHBORHOOD
I CAME UP IN.

716
00:37:51.085 --> 00:37:52.229
SEE.
WE KNEW THE POLICE.

717
00:37:52.253 --> 00:37:53.631
(all murmuring agreement)
SEE?

718
00:37:53.655 --> 00:37:55.266
WE HAD A WHITE
POLICE OFFICER.

719
00:37:55.290 --> 00:37:57.941
OUR HOUSE WAS ON HIS BEAT.
ON HIS FOOT BEAT.

720
00:37:58.009 --> 00:37:59.242
AND HE WOULD BE

721
00:37:59.311 --> 00:38:01.789
SITTIN' OUT
TALKIN' TO MY MOTHER
DAMN NEAR EVERY NIGHT.

722
00:38:01.813 --> 00:38:04.097
I MEAN. JUST SITTIN' OUT
ON HER STOOP. JUST TALKIN'.

723
00:38:04.166 --> 00:38:07.400
AND I'M TELLIN' YOU THAT
THIS MAN. HIS NAME WAS.
UH. FRASIER O'LEARY.

724
00:38:07.469 --> 00:38:09.480
YOU KNOW. HE EVEN KNEW
MY GRANDMOTHER BY NAME.

725
00:38:09.504 --> 00:38:10.765
YOU KNOW?
Y-Y-YES. MA'AM.

726
00:38:10.789 --> 00:38:12.805
LET'S MOVE ON TO
THE TIP-LINE INFORMATION...

727
00:38:12.874 --> 00:38:15.602
I'M SO SORRY. BABY.
I'M REAL SORRY.
BUT I WAS NOT FINISHED.

728
00:38:15.626 --> 00:38:17.755
(all agreeing)
YOU SEE. LET ME
TELL YOU SOMETHIN'.

729
00:38:17.779 --> 00:38:22.815
I HAVE NOT SEEN THAT
FACE-TO-FACE POLICIN'
IN A LONG WHILE.

730
00:38:22.883 --> 00:38:26.119
IN A VERY LONG WHILE.
UNTIL LAST WEEK.

731
00:38:26.187 --> 00:38:27.798
A YOUNG OFFICER.
BLACK OFFICER.

732
00:38:27.822 --> 00:38:29.722
CAME BY MY STOOP.
I WAS SITTIN' OUT.

733
00:38:29.790 --> 00:38:30.940
GAVE ME HIS CARD.

734
00:38:31.009 --> 00:38:32.625
HIS NAME IS REGGIE BALLARD.

735
00:38:32.694 --> 00:38:34.727
(sergeant agreeing)
IS HIS NAME. RIGHT?

736
00:38:34.795 --> 00:38:37.358
AND HE SAT.
AND HE TALKED TO ME.
WE JUST TALKED.

737
00:38:37.382 --> 00:38:39.449
AND. SEE. NOW I KNOW
HIS NAME AND FACE

738
00:38:39.518 --> 00:38:41.551
AND HE KNOWS
MY NAME AND FACE.

739
00:38:41.620 --> 00:38:43.598
YOU SEE?
AND I'M GONNA
TELL YOU SOMETHIN'.

740
00:38:43.622 --> 00:38:45.654
THAT IS HOW IT SHOULD BE.

741
00:38:45.723 --> 00:38:47.807
(all clapping)

742
00:38:50.328 --> 00:38:53.596
MY SON WANNA OPEN UP
ONE OF 'EM SNOWBALL
STANDS ON THE STREET.

743
00:38:53.665 --> 00:38:55.331
DO WE NEED
A PERMIT FOR THIS?

744
00:38:57.619 --> 00:39:00.420
YOU EVER SEEN A WEST SIDE
COMMUNITY MEETIN'
LIKE THIS ONE?

745
00:39:00.489 --> 00:39:03.539
(sergeant)
IN FACT. THE FOLKS DOWNTOWN
AT MINOR PRIVILEGES TELL ME

746
00:39:03.608 --> 00:39:06.409
THAT STANDS AREN'T
ALLOWED IN THE CITY
RIGHT-OF-WAY AT ALL.

747
00:39:06.478 --> 00:39:09.829
NOW THEY DO SAY
IT IS POSSIBLE TO HAVE
A SNOWBALL STAND

748
00:39:09.898 --> 00:39:11.480
BEHIND THE SIDEWALK.

749
00:39:17.522 --> 00:39:19.722
WHY ARE YOU REALLY
DOWN HERE. COUNCILMAN?

750
00:39:21.193 --> 00:39:23.225
I MEAN. THIS AIN'T
EVEN YOUR DISTRICT.

751
00:39:23.294 --> 00:39:25.127
I'M INTERESTED.

752
00:39:25.196 --> 00:39:27.479
AND I HAVE THE PUBLIC
SAFETY SUBCOMMITTEE.

753
00:39:31.986 --> 00:39:33.686
YOU SEE THAT BUILDIN' THERE?

754
00:39:35.823 --> 00:39:37.724
IT WAS THE
OLD STRYKER BUILDIN'.

755
00:39:37.792 --> 00:39:39.325
IT WAS A FUNERAL PARLOR.

756
00:39:39.393 --> 00:39:42.328
THE LAST STOP
BEFORE THE CEMETERY
FOR WEST SIDE WHITE FOLK.

757
00:39:42.396 --> 00:39:44.781
BACK WHEN THERE WERE
STILL SOME OF THOSE AROUND.

758
00:39:44.833 --> 00:39:47.266
RIGHT ABOUT
THE TIME THAT. UH.

759
00:39:47.335 --> 00:39:49.852
JIM CROW WAS BREAKIN' UP.
BACK IN THE EARLY '60s.

760
00:39:49.921 --> 00:39:53.156
SOMEBODY ASKED
OLD MAN STRYKER.
THEY SAY. "STRYKER.

761
00:39:53.224 --> 00:39:54.923
"YOU GONNA CHANGE YOUR POLICY

762
00:39:54.992 --> 00:39:57.860
A-A-AND START
BURYIN' BLACK FOLK?"

763
00:39:57.928 --> 00:39:59.828
AND STRYKER SAID.

764
00:39:59.897 --> 00:40:03.599
"YEAH. ON ONE CONDITION.

765
00:40:03.668 --> 00:40:05.401
THAT I CAN DO 'EM
ALL AT ONCE."

766
00:40:09.240 --> 00:40:10.873
THAT'S SICK.

767
00:40:10.942 --> 00:40:13.026
BUT YOU KNOW SOMETHIN'?

768
00:40:13.094 --> 00:40:15.028
I HAD A LOT OF RESPECT
FOR THAT MAN.

769
00:40:16.164 --> 00:40:18.131
'CAUSE. UNLIKE MOST FOLKS.

770
00:40:18.199 --> 00:40:20.099
I ALWAYS KNEW WHERE HE STOOD.

771
00:40:21.018 --> 00:40:22.352
I'M DOIN' MY JOB.

772
00:40:24.922 --> 00:40:26.889
(chuckling)

773
00:40:28.726 --> 00:40:30.660
LOOK. I DONE
SHOWED YOU THE GOOD.

774
00:40:31.763 --> 00:40:33.530
COME ON.
LET ME SHOW YOU THE UGLY.

775
00:40:40.872 --> 00:40:42.505
(phone ringing)

776
00:40:47.996 --> 00:40:51.046
HEY.
HOW COME SO QUICK?

777
00:40:51.115 --> 00:40:52.715
STRINGER BELL'S GIVEN NAME.

778
00:40:52.784 --> 00:40:54.099
RUSSELL.

779
00:40:54.168 --> 00:40:55.301
FOR NOW?

780
00:40:55.837 --> 00:40:57.052
AHMED.

781
00:41:03.294 --> 00:41:05.394
WE'RE ON THE TOP
OF THE MOUNTAIN.

782
00:41:08.883 --> 00:41:10.516
(beeping)

783
00:41:12.137 --> 00:41:14.298
(man)
RED TOPS OVER HERE.
COME GET 'EM. COME GET 'EM.

784
00:41:14.322 --> 00:41:15.738
RED TOPS.

785
00:41:15.807 --> 00:41:17.807
(people chattering)

786
00:41:27.685 --> 00:41:29.152
(Carcetti)
THIS IS IT?

787
00:41:29.220 --> 00:41:30.620
(Bunny)
1 OF 3.

788
00:41:30.688 --> 00:41:32.571
HOW DID YOU
MAKE THIS HAPPEN?

789
00:41:34.442 --> 00:41:36.075
I JUST DID IT.

790
00:41:38.196 --> 00:41:41.830
I GOT TIRED OF HEARIN'
FOLKS TALK ABOUT
WHAT NEEDS TO BE DONE

791
00:41:41.899 --> 00:41:44.967
OR WHAT THEY WOULD DO
IF IT WAS UP TO THEM.

792
00:41:45.036 --> 00:41:47.336
(man)
BOTTLE ROCKETS.
GOT THEM BOTTLE ROCKETS.

793
00:41:47.405 --> 00:41:49.639
SO. WHAT. THIS IS
ABOUT YOU MAKIN' A MARK?

794
00:41:50.958 --> 00:41:55.261
NO. I AIN'T ANALYZED IT
ALL THAT DEEP.

795
00:41:55.330 --> 00:41:58.381
I AIN'T CLAIMIN'
NO KIND OF VICTORY.
NEITHER.

796
00:41:58.450 --> 00:42:01.650
I WILL SAY I...
I'M GLAD I TRIED.

797
00:42:05.356 --> 00:42:06.923
GO ON. COUNCILMAN.

798
00:42:08.059 --> 00:42:09.942
I'LL WAIT FOR YOU DOWN HERE.

799
00:42:11.062 --> 00:42:12.461
YOU'RE NOT COMIN'?

800
00:42:14.432 --> 00:42:16.332
NOW. WHAT YOU GONNA
SEE AIN'T PRETTY.

801
00:42:16.901 --> 00:42:18.300
BUT IT'S SAFE.

802
00:42:18.370 --> 00:42:20.470
(man)
W.M.D.s. GOT THEM W.M.D.s.

803
00:42:20.538 --> 00:42:23.339
I THINK YOU NEED
TO TAKE THIS JOURNEY
YOUR OWN SELF.

804
00:42:23.407 --> 00:42:24.407
(inaudible)

805
00:42:29.113 --> 00:42:30.979
(man)
GOT THOSE YELLOW.
THOSE YELLOW TOPS.

806
00:42:31.048 --> 00:42:32.398
YELLOW TOPS RIGHT HERE.

807
00:42:35.486 --> 00:42:38.054
(noisy chattering)

808
00:42:59.177 --> 00:43:01.343
(piano music playing)

809
00:43:01.412 --> 00:43:03.279
(people chattering)

810
00:43:07.618 --> 00:43:09.285
I ORDERED ONE FOR YOU.

811
00:43:10.155 --> 00:43:11.353
THANKS.

812
00:43:12.773 --> 00:43:14.057
SURPRISED I CALLED?

813
00:43:14.125 --> 00:43:15.858
A LITTLE.

814
00:43:15.927 --> 00:43:17.593
AFTER THE WAY WE LEFT IT.

815
00:43:17.662 --> 00:43:19.195
HMM.

816
00:43:19.264 --> 00:43:20.797
I'M A TYPE "A." JIMMY.

817
00:43:22.366 --> 00:43:24.284
PEOPLE LIKE ME BREAK THINGS.

818
00:43:24.352 --> 00:43:25.652
WHEN I SLOW DOWN.

819
00:43:25.720 --> 00:43:28.153
OR WHEN I TAKE A MINUTE
TO THINK ABOUT IT. I...

820
00:43:30.491 --> 00:43:32.441
IS THAT YOUR
IDEA OF AN APOLOGY?

821
00:43:33.711 --> 00:43:36.245
I DIDN'T DRIVE
AN HOUR UP 95 TO APOLOGIZE.

822
00:43:38.249 --> 00:43:39.482
I MISSED YOU.

823
00:43:42.337 --> 00:43:43.569
(exhaling deeply)

824
00:43:45.055 --> 00:43:47.256
I MISSED YOU. TOO.
I GUESS.

825
00:43:47.325 --> 00:43:49.676
STILL. SEEMS A LONG WAY
TO COME JUST TO TELL ME THAT.

826
00:43:49.744 --> 00:43:52.261
THEN TURN AROUND
AND DRIVE BACK DOWN TO D.C.

827
00:43:52.330 --> 00:43:53.997
I'M NOT DRIVING BACK TONIGHT.

828
00:44:02.006 --> 00:44:03.272
SO WHAT'S GOIN' ON?

829
00:44:03.341 --> 00:44:04.574
ARE YOU WORKIN' ON A CASE?

830
00:44:04.642 --> 00:44:06.209
MMM-HMM.
IT'S A GOOD ONE.

831
00:44:07.978 --> 00:44:10.946
HOW ABOUT YOU?
ANYTHING INTERESTING?

832
00:44:11.015 --> 00:44:14.817
I DID HEAR
A CRAZY BALTIMORE STORY.

833
00:44:14.885 --> 00:44:17.353
YOU KNOW.
THROUGH THE RUMOR MILL
OF WASHINGTON.

834
00:44:17.955 --> 00:44:19.321
REALLY?

835
00:44:19.391 --> 00:44:20.890
SOME...

836
00:44:20.958 --> 00:44:24.961
RENEGADE POLICE COMMANDER
TAKES IT ON HIMSELF TO. UH...

837
00:44:25.029 --> 00:44:28.147
I DON'T KNOW.
LEGALIZE DRUGS
IN THE PRECINCT?

838
00:44:28.216 --> 00:44:30.432
MAYOR DOESN'T
EVEN KNOW ABOUT IT?

839
00:44:30.501 --> 00:44:32.201
CAN YOU BELIEVE THAT?

840
00:44:32.270 --> 00:44:33.669
CRAZY STORY.

841
00:44:34.205 --> 00:44:35.320
SOMEONE...

842
00:44:36.891 --> 00:44:38.423
I THINK IT'S COLVIN.

843
00:44:39.460 --> 00:44:40.710
YOU KNOW HIM?

844
00:44:43.447 --> 00:44:45.181
NO. I CAN'T SAY THAT I DO.

845
00:44:47.484 --> 00:44:50.485
STILL. I THINK
IT'S FUNNY THAT SOME. UH.

846
00:44:50.554 --> 00:44:52.621
WATER-COOLER TALKER
DOWN IN D.C.

847
00:44:52.690 --> 00:44:54.489
KNOWS ANY
BALTIMORE COP'S NAME.

848
00:44:57.845 --> 00:44:59.161
I WAS JUST WONDERING.

849
00:45:00.681 --> 00:45:02.882
(diners laughing and chattering)

850
00:45:09.157 --> 00:45:10.556
LISTEN. I'M. UH...

851
00:45:13.411 --> 00:45:15.211
YOU'RE LEAVING?
YEAH. I THINK SO.

852
00:45:17.449 --> 00:45:18.498
GOOD NIGHT.

853
00:45:26.273 --> 00:45:29.608
DAMN. MAN.
I MISS THIS CRIB ALREADY.

854
00:45:29.677 --> 00:45:32.177
YEAH. WELL. YOU SPENDIN'
A LOT OF TIME
AT THE OTHER SPOT

855
00:45:32.246 --> 00:45:33.612
DOIN' WHAT YOU GOTTA DO.

856
00:45:33.681 --> 00:45:34.681
YEAH.

857
00:45:35.783 --> 00:45:37.282
MAN. IT'S A SHAME
WE GOT TO DEAL

858
00:45:37.351 --> 00:45:38.818
WITH THIS
MARLO BULLSHIT. MAN.

859
00:45:38.886 --> 00:45:41.070
I MEAN. IF I HAD
TAKEN CARE OF THAT
EARLIER. MAN...

860
00:45:41.138 --> 00:45:43.506
THERE'S ALWAYS
GONNA BE A MARLO. MAN.

861
00:45:43.575 --> 00:45:46.409
NO MARLO. NO GAME.

862
00:45:46.477 --> 00:45:49.223
BUT YOU COULD'VE DEALT
WITH THAT SHIT A LITTLE
SOONER. I MEAN. YEAH.

863
00:45:49.247 --> 00:45:52.381
BUT. YOU KNOW WHAT
I'M SAYIN'? DON'T LET IT
LAY ON YOU LIKE THAT.

864
00:45:52.450 --> 00:45:56.869
TONIGHT. I MEAN.
I'M GONNA KICK BACK
AND JUST ENJOY THIS VIEW.

865
00:45:58.439 --> 00:46:00.072
I MEAN.
LOOK AT THIS SHIT.

866
00:46:00.141 --> 00:46:01.769
CAN YOU FUCKIN'
BELIEVE THIS?

867
00:46:01.793 --> 00:46:03.837
I MEAN. I GOT A CRIB
THAT'S OVERLOOKIN'
THE HARBOR.

868
00:46:03.861 --> 00:46:06.456
THIS IS THE SAME PLACE...
WE USED TO RUN
THROUGH THIS MOTHERFUCKER.

869
00:46:06.480 --> 00:46:09.665
WE HAD EVERY
SECURITY GUARD IN THERE
FOLLOWIN' US.

870
00:46:09.733 --> 00:46:11.000
AS THEY SHOULD HAVE.

871
00:46:11.069 --> 00:46:12.834
TRUE. TRUE.

872
00:46:12.903 --> 00:46:14.347
AND THEN THERE
WAS THAT ONE TIME...

873
00:46:14.371 --> 00:46:15.855
TOY STORE?

874
00:46:15.924 --> 00:46:18.769
HELL. YEAH. I TOLD
YOUR ASS NOT TO STEAL
THE BADMINTON SET.

875
00:46:18.793 --> 00:46:21.460
WHAT YOU GONNA DO
WITH A FUCKIN' NET

876
00:46:21.529 --> 00:46:24.280
AND A RACKET AND WE
AIN'T GOT NO YARD.

877
00:46:24.816 --> 00:46:26.181
FUCK.

878
00:46:26.250 --> 00:46:28.662
YOU LIKE. "YO.
THAT WHITE BOY AIN'T GONNA
JUMP OVER THAT COUNTER

879
00:46:28.686 --> 00:46:29.885
AND COME CHASE AFTER ME."

880
00:46:29.954 --> 00:46:31.297
HE SURE DID. THOUGH.
THEN HE SAID...

881
00:46:31.321 --> 00:46:32.733
(whooshing)
I SAID. "WHAT THE FUCK?"

882
00:46:32.757 --> 00:46:34.517
HE WAS ON YOUR
ASS LIKE CARL LEWIS.

883
00:46:34.558 --> 00:46:35.925
FISTS WAS ROLLED UP.

884
00:46:35.993 --> 00:46:38.527
YOUR ASS WAS RUNNIN'. TOO.
FAST AS YOU COULD.

885
00:46:38.595 --> 00:46:41.008
PUNCHIN' YOURSELF
IN THE CHEST.
LOOKIN' ALL MAD AND SHIT.

886
00:46:41.032 --> 00:46:42.197
(screaming)

887
00:46:42.266 --> 00:46:44.099
THAT SHIT
WAS CRAZY. MAN.

888
00:46:44.168 --> 00:46:47.436
RIGHT HERE. TOO. MAN.
RIGHT THERE. GODDAMN.

889
00:46:47.504 --> 00:46:49.471
(distant sirens wailing)

890
00:46:49.540 --> 00:46:52.340
CAN YOU IMAGINE. MAN.
IF I HAD THE MONEY
THAT I HAVE NOW. MAN.

891
00:46:52.409 --> 00:46:55.377
I COULD HAVE
BOUGHT HALF THIS
WATERFRONT PROPERTY.

892
00:46:55.446 --> 00:46:56.662
GOD DAMN IT.

893
00:46:57.932 --> 00:47:00.366
AH. FORGET ABOUT THAT
FOR A WHILE. MAN.

894
00:47:02.069 --> 00:47:03.769
YOU KNOW.
JUST DREAM WITH ME.

895
00:47:07.157 --> 00:47:09.325
WE AIN'T GOTTA
DREAM NO MORE. MAN.

896
00:47:11.929 --> 00:47:14.029
WE GOT REAL SHIT.

897
00:47:14.098 --> 00:47:16.264
REAL ESTATE. WE CAN TOUCH.

898
00:47:24.225 --> 00:47:26.492
I CAN'T GET TOO
FUCKED UP TONIGHT. MAN.

899
00:47:26.561 --> 00:47:29.128
I GOT SOME SHIT
I GOTTA DO ON THE SITE
TOMORROW.

900
00:47:29.196 --> 00:47:33.615
PLUS. THE FUCKIN' POLACK
WE GOT WORKIN' FOR US. MAN.

901
00:47:34.351 --> 00:47:36.218
I GOTTA PULL HIS COAT.

902
00:47:36.287 --> 00:47:38.988
IF HE HAD ANYTHING
TO DO WITH THAT
CLAY DAVIS BULLSHIT. MAN.

903
00:47:39.056 --> 00:47:41.307
I'M GONNA HAVE
TO CUT HIS MONEY.
LITTLE FAGGOT.

904
00:47:42.243 --> 00:47:43.975
WHAT TIME Y'ALL MEETIN'?

905
00:47:48.699 --> 00:47:50.732
UH...

906
00:47:50.801 --> 00:47:55.070
WHAT TIME? UH. 12:00.
UH. I THINK. WHY?

907
00:47:55.139 --> 00:47:57.339
YOU... YOU NEED ME TO DO
SOMETHIN' FOR YOU?

908
00:47:58.642 --> 00:48:00.842
NO. I'M JUST SEEIN'
WHERE YOU GOIN' TO BE AT.

909
00:48:03.615 --> 00:48:05.447
YOU NEED TO RELAX MORE. MAN.

910
00:48:08.219 --> 00:48:11.337
WELL. WHEN THE TIME
IS RIGHT. I WILL.

911
00:48:13.608 --> 00:48:16.092
YOU KNOW. I DON'T TAKE
MY WORK TOO SERIOUSLY.

912
00:48:17.845 --> 00:48:18.944
THAT'S RIGHT.

913
00:48:22.517 --> 00:48:23.716
IT'S JUST BUSINESS.

914
00:48:33.728 --> 00:48:35.427
(sighing)
US. MOTHERFUCKER.

915
00:48:39.216 --> 00:48:40.515
US. MAN.

916
00:49:12.884 --> 00:49:15.100
(both grunting)

917
00:49:20.358 --> 00:49:22.674
(boy #1)
GET HIM. ANDRE. GO GET HIM.

918
00:49:22.743 --> 00:49:24.904
(boy #2)
COME ON. SPIDER.
YOU GOT HIM. COME ON.

919
00:49:24.928 --> 00:49:26.178
(bell clanging)

920
00:49:28.298 --> 00:49:29.465
EASY. EASY. EASY.

921
00:49:30.635 --> 00:49:32.129
ALL RIGHT?
I'M GOOD. I'M GOOD.

922
00:49:32.153 --> 00:49:33.519
ALL RIGHT.

923
00:49:33.587 --> 00:49:34.836
ALL RIGHT. DITTY. YOU UP.

924
00:49:34.905 --> 00:49:36.300
(boy #1)
WHY DIDN'T YOU
HIT HIM BACK. MAN?

925
00:49:36.324 --> 00:49:37.489
YOU. JUSTIN.

926
00:49:38.709 --> 00:49:40.576
COME ON. BOY.
I'M CALLIN' YOUR NAME.

927
00:49:45.083 --> 00:49:46.182
ALL RIGHT. LISTEN UP.

928
00:49:46.250 --> 00:49:48.117
WE GONNA HAVE 3
2-MINUTE ROUNDS.

929
00:49:48.186 --> 00:49:50.352
WATCH THE LOW BLOWS.
TOUCH GLOVES.

930
00:49:55.276 --> 00:49:56.458
AND...

931
00:49:56.527 --> 00:49:57.559
(clanging)

932
00:49:57.628 --> 00:49:59.361
(boy #2)
LET'S GO. JUSTIN.

933
00:49:59.430 --> 00:50:02.130
JUSTIN. COME ON.
COME ON.

934
00:50:02.199 --> 00:50:03.765
THAT'S GOOD.
THAT'S GOOD.

935
00:50:03.834 --> 00:50:05.712
(boy #2)
STRAIGHT SHOT.
COME ON.

936
00:50:05.736 --> 00:50:07.770
GET YOUR HANDS UP.
JUSTIN.

937
00:50:07.839 --> 00:50:09.538
COME ON. MAN.
COME ON.

938
00:50:09.607 --> 00:50:10.823
YOU GOTTA BLOCK THAT.

939
00:50:10.891 --> 00:50:13.408
(Cutty)
HE LEADIN' LEFT AND
PUNCHIN' RIGHT. JUSTIN.

940
00:50:13.477 --> 00:50:15.711
MOVE TOWARDS HIS WEAK SIDE.

941
00:50:15.780 --> 00:50:17.279
(boy)
HE ONLY COME UP
TO YOUR WAIST.

942
00:50:17.348 --> 00:50:18.425
(Cutty)
OH. MAN. BELL.

943
00:50:18.449 --> 00:50:20.249
(bell clanging)

944
00:50:20.317 --> 00:50:21.528
THAT WAS
A QUICK 2 MINUTES.

945
00:50:21.552 --> 00:50:22.651
YEAH. I KNOW.

946
00:50:22.720 --> 00:50:24.853
GET YOU SOME WATER.
BOY. AND SPIT IT OUT.

947
00:50:28.159 --> 00:50:30.292
YOU ALL RIGHT?
DIZZY.

948
00:50:30.361 --> 00:50:33.495
THAT'S WHY THE HELL
I KEEP TELLIN' YOU
YOU GOT TO BREATHE. BOY.

949
00:50:33.564 --> 00:50:35.397
SO. WHAT?
YOU HAD ENOUGH?

950
00:50:35.466 --> 00:50:36.598
NO. I'M GOOD.

951
00:50:36.667 --> 00:50:38.800
ALL RIGHT.
ALL RIGHT.

952
00:50:38.869 --> 00:50:40.069
(bell clanging)

953
00:50:40.137 --> 00:50:41.303
(boy #1)
LET'S GO. JUSTIN.

954
00:50:41.372 --> 00:50:42.583
(boy #2)
LET'S GO. JUSTIN!

955
00:50:42.607 --> 00:50:44.385
COME ON. JUSTIN.
LET'S GO. JUSTIN.

956
00:50:44.409 --> 00:50:46.086
LET'S GO. JUSTIN.
COME ON.

957
00:50:46.110 --> 00:50:48.494
(fighters grunting)
JAB. JUSTIN. GOTTA JAB.

958
00:50:53.233 --> 00:50:54.900
(computer bleeping)
HMM.

959
00:51:03.043 --> 00:51:05.144
HEY. WE'RE UP. HERE IT IS.

960
00:51:05.212 --> 00:51:06.245
(man)
<i>It's me. man.</i>

961
00:51:06.313 --> 00:51:07.608
(Stringer)
<i>You heard from</i>
<i>the fat man?</i>

962
00:51:07.632 --> 00:51:08.697
<i>Yeah.</i>

963
00:51:08.766 --> 00:51:10.711
<i>We low. right?</i>
<i>One mark shy</i>
<i>of the mark.</i>

964
00:51:10.735 --> 00:51:12.034
<i>Yeah. it's light.</i>

965
00:51:12.103 --> 00:51:13.803
<i>Cherry say it's light.</i>

966
00:51:13.871 --> 00:51:16.005
<i>Tell the man I'm doin'
what needs done.</i>

967
00:51:16.073 --> 00:51:17.640
<i>All right. I'll tell him.</i>

968
00:51:17.708 --> 00:51:19.887
<i>Oh. and that other thing?
What?</i>

969
00:51:19.911 --> 00:51:21.543
<i>Them 2 hitters you asked after.</i>

970
00:51:21.612 --> 00:51:23.612
<i>He good with it.
Not on the phone.</i>

971
00:51:23.681 --> 00:51:24.796
(beeping)

972
00:51:26.667 --> 00:51:27.799
THAT'S IT.

973
00:51:28.402 --> 00:51:30.452
WE GOT IT!

974
00:51:30.521 --> 00:51:32.955
(all laughing)

975
00:51:36.827 --> 00:51:38.611
(Pearlman)
GOOD WORK.

976
00:51:38.679 --> 00:51:41.263
(Freamon hooting)

977
00:51:41.315 --> 00:51:43.466
(Freamon)
I GUESS THIS IS PERTINENT.

978
00:51:44.068 --> 00:51:45.200
YEAH!

979
00:51:48.406 --> 00:51:50.572
(boys shouting and cheering)

980
00:52:05.306 --> 00:52:06.388
(bell clanging)

981
00:52:08.425 --> 00:52:10.025
(clapping)

982
00:52:12.630 --> 00:52:14.662
AIN'T NO NEED
TO GO BACK OUT.

983
00:52:14.731 --> 00:52:16.682
YOU AIN'T GOT
TO PROVE NOTHIN'.

984
00:52:16.767 --> 00:52:18.867
SHOOT. MY MOMMA HIT
ME HARDER THAN THAT.

985
00:52:18.936 --> 00:52:20.953
I STILL GOT A CHANCE.
HE GETTIN' TIRED.

986
00:52:21.022 --> 00:52:22.671
MMM-HMM.
DRINK AND SPIT.

987
00:52:26.143 --> 00:52:27.243
READY.

988
00:52:27.311 --> 00:52:28.905
YOU MORE THAN
READY. BOY.

989
00:52:28.929 --> 00:52:31.413
YOU GAME ROOSTER.

990
00:52:31.482 --> 00:52:32.731
(boy #1)
LET'S GO. JUSTIN.

991
00:52:32.800 --> 00:52:34.320
(boy #2)
HEY. JUSTIN.

992
00:52:35.136 --> 00:52:37.219
(boys cheering)

993
00:52:37.988 --> 00:52:39.955
(vehicles passing)

994
00:52:48.482 --> 00:52:50.215
IS THERE
AN ALLEY ENTRANCE?

995
00:52:51.051 --> 00:52:52.918
BOARDED UP
ON BOTH SIDES.

996
00:52:52.987 --> 00:52:55.153
SO WE GONNA HAVE TO
GO THROUGH THE FRONT.

997
00:52:56.289 --> 00:52:58.189
THAT'S A CHANGE
FOR YOU. ISN'T IT?

998
00:53:00.060 --> 00:53:01.727
YOU JUST BE READY.
BOW TIE.

999
00:53:01.795 --> 00:53:03.495
YOU KNOW WHAT
I'M TALKIN' ABOUT?

1000
00:53:09.253 --> 00:53:11.136
(boys shouting)

1001
00:53:12.122 --> 00:53:13.922
BREATHE. BOY. BREATHE.

1002
00:53:21.048 --> 00:53:22.630
(Cutty)
TOUCH GLOVES.

1003
00:53:28.221 --> 00:53:29.288
HOW'D I DO?

1004
00:53:29.356 --> 00:53:30.984
YOU STILL GOT
PLENTY TO LEARN.

1005
00:53:31.008 --> 00:53:34.142
BUT ON THE HEART SIDE?
YOU DID GOOD.

1006
00:53:34.778 --> 00:53:36.779
(boys cheering)

1007
00:53:39.283 --> 00:53:41.984
GO ON HOME. SOLDIER.
YOU DONE FOR THE DAY.

1008
00:53:42.052 --> 00:53:43.752
(boy #1)
YEAH. JUSTIN!

1009
00:53:44.789 --> 00:53:47.005
(cheering and clapping)

1010
00:53:49.327 --> 00:53:50.938
OH. I CAN SEE IT
ALL CLEARLY NOW.

1011
00:53:50.962 --> 00:53:52.472
BETWEEN YOU AND
THEM SUBCONTRACTORS

1012
00:53:52.496 --> 00:53:54.007
AND THAT
MOTHERFUCKIN' POLITICIAN.

1013
00:53:54.031 --> 00:53:55.475
Y'ALL HAD ME
IN A SPIN. RIGHT?

1014
00:53:55.499 --> 00:53:56.739
MR. BELL.
I DON'T KNOW...

1015
00:53:56.800 --> 00:53:57.983
LITTLE MAN!

1016
00:53:58.052 --> 00:53:59.892
WE GONNA GET ALL
THIS SHIT SORTED OUT.

1017
00:53:59.954 --> 00:54:01.765
AND. HEY. IF THE SHIT
DON'T COME UP RIGHT.

1018
00:54:01.789 --> 00:54:04.156
ONE WAY OR ANOTHER
YOU GONNA PAY FOR THIS SHIT.

1019
00:54:04.242 --> 00:54:06.236
LOOK.
I UNDERSTAND YOU'RE ANGRY.
BUT AT THE SAME TIME

1020
00:54:06.260 --> 00:54:07.838
YOU CAN SEE THE PROGRESS
WE'VE MADE IN HERE.

1021
00:54:07.862 --> 00:54:09.261
PROGRESS.
NOW I HONESTLY

1022
00:54:09.330 --> 00:54:11.090
DON'T KNOW WHAT
PASSED BETWEEN YOU
AND SENATOR DAVIS.

1023
00:54:11.114 --> 00:54:12.943
BUT IF YOU'RE UNHAPPY
WITH CLAYTON'S PERFORMANCE.

1024
00:54:12.967 --> 00:54:14.700
THEN YOU HAVE TO
WORK THAT OUT...

1025
00:54:15.786 --> 00:54:16.885
SHIT.

1026
00:54:16.954 --> 00:54:18.120
(man)
OH. GOD.

1027
00:54:19.489 --> 00:54:20.688
OH. GOD. NO.

1028
00:54:25.630 --> 00:54:27.179
(man pleading)

1029
00:54:27.248 --> 00:54:29.081
OH. GOD. NO. NO...

1030
00:54:31.652 --> 00:54:33.302
(footsteps clattering)

1031
00:54:55.542 --> 00:54:57.025
(panting)

1032
00:55:01.331 --> 00:55:02.531
I AIN'T STRAPPED.

1033
00:55:07.737 --> 00:55:11.940
LOOK. MAN.
I AIN'T INVOLVED.

1034
00:55:12.009 --> 00:55:14.676
I AIN'T INVOLVED
IN THAT GANGSTER
BULLSHIT NO MORE.

1035
00:55:22.235 --> 00:55:23.802
WHAT Y'ALL NIGGERS
WANT. MAN?

1036
00:55:23.870 --> 00:55:25.921
HUH? MONEY?

1037
00:55:30.394 --> 00:55:32.994
IS THAT IT?

1038
00:55:33.063 --> 00:55:36.565
'CAUSE IF IT IS. MAN.
I CAN BE A BETTER
FRIEND TO Y'ALL ALIVE.

1039
00:55:39.119 --> 00:55:40.719
YOU STILL DON'T
GET IT. DO YOU?

1040
00:55:41.321 --> 00:55:42.821
HUH?

1041
00:55:42.890 --> 00:55:44.723
THIS AIN'T ABOUT
YOUR MONEY. BRO.

1042
00:55:45.960 --> 00:55:47.343
YOUR BOY GAVE YOU UP.

1043
00:55:49.646 --> 00:55:50.946
(Omar)
THAT'S RIGHT.

1044
00:55:51.015 --> 00:55:53.431
AND WE AIN'T HAD TO
TORTURE HIS ASS. NEITHER.

1045
00:56:10.233 --> 00:56:12.701
WELL. IT SEEM LIKE...

1046
00:56:12.770 --> 00:56:15.236
I CAN'T SAY NOTHIN'
TO CHANGE Y'ALL MINDS.

1047
00:56:28.201 --> 00:56:30.219
WELL. GET ON WITH IT.
MOTHER...

1048
00:56:32.739 --> 00:56:34.273
(shell casings clinking)

1049
00:56:59.650 --> 00:57:01.883
(train rattling by)

